url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/0d2c900a21255470940bf5c0024c097e4e76dfee","node_id":"C_kwDODJ1vatoAKDBkMmM5MDBhMjEyNTU0NzA5NDBiZjVjMDAyNGMwOTdlNGU3NmRmZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/2cf6ee101af76b0663d06faabbf0747a3950b698","sha":"2cf6ee101af76b0663d06faabbf0747a3950b698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/2cf6ee101af76b0663d06faabbf0747a3950b698"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/cdba8db7460c0926a0e39e435da55b12d41716a7","sha":"cdba8db7460c0926a0e39e435da55b12d41716a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/cdba8db7460c0926a0e39e435da55b12d41716a7"}],"sha":"0d2c900a21255470940bf5c0024c097e4e76dfee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/0d2c900a21255470940bf5c0024c097e4e76dfee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879913?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SpicyPete","id":879913,"login":"SpicyPete","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTkxMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/2cf6ee101af76b0663d06faabbf0747a3950b698/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:28:37Z","email":"879913+SpicyPete@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pete."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:28:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"frontend: update the UI registry past 3.4.1 (#2659)\n\nThe vendored copies under `redpanda-ui/` had fallen behind the deployed registry:\n137 of 166 files differed, none of them cosmetically. Pulled by writing the\npublished bytes for all 92 installed items, then asserting byte-parity for every\ntarget. No item carries a `cssVars`, `css` or `tailwind` payload and no target\nfalls outside the vendored directory, so the direct write is equivalent to a CLI\npull. `bun run lint` leaves the result at parity.\n\nTwo items arrive with it. `sanitized-html` is new in the closure, required by\n`code-block`, `code-tabs` and `code-block-dynamic`, all of which are installed.\n`auto-form/renderers/renderer-types.ts` is a new file in the auto-form item.\n\nDependencies follow the registry where console was behind it: `@base-ui/react`\nto ^1.8.0, `@tanstack/react-table` to ^9.2.3 and `zod` to ^4.6.1. `lottie-web` is\npromoted to a direct dependency because `loading-animation.tsx` imports it and it\nwas only reaching us through `lottie-react`. `dompurify`, which `sanitized-html`\nneeds, was already pinned at the range it asks for.\n\n`Link` now requires `href`, so the two react-markdown anchor renderers render a\ndestinationless anchor as text instead of a dead link.\n\n`style/theme.css` changes are rewrapped shadow values and one declaration\nreorder. All 207 custom properties are unchanged, so the token contract with\ncloud-ui is untouched and this needs no paired change there.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16d8c0a190a022d219f88ba9d8e0ae6613dc7d66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/trees/16d8c0a190a022d219f88ba9d8e0ae6613dc7d66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/commits/2cf6ee101af76b0663d06faabbf0747a3950b698","verification":{"payload":"tree 16d8c0a190a022d219f88ba9d8e0ae6613dc7d66\nparent 6c9f67343769597620f2fb6da439eed490affeae\nauthor Pete. <879913+SpicyPete@users.noreply.github.com> 1790098117 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790098117 -0700\n\nfrontend: update the UI registry past 3.4.1 (#2659)\n\nThe vendored copies under `redpanda-ui/` had fallen behind the deployed registry:\n137 of 166 files differed, none of them cosmetically. Pulled by writing the\npublished bytes for all 92 installed items, then asserting byte-parity for every\ntarget. No item carries a `cssVars`, `css` or `tailwind` payload and no target\nfalls outside the vendored directory, so the direct write is equivalent to a CLI\npull. `bun run lint` leaves the result at parity.\n\nTwo items arrive with it. `sanitized-html` is new in the closure, required by\n`code-block`, `code-tabs` and `code-block-dynamic`, all of which are installed.\n`auto-form/renderers/renderer-types.ts` is a new file in the auto-form item.\n\nDependencies follow the registry where console was behind it: `@base-ui/react`\nto ^1.8.0, `@tanstack/react-table` to ^9.2.3 and `zod` to ^4.6.1. `lottie-web` is\npromoted to a direct dependency because `loading-animation.tsx` imports it and it\nwas only reaching us through `lottie-react`. `dompurify`, which `sanitized-html`\nneeds, was already pinned at the range it asks for.\n\n`Link` now requires `href`, so the two react-markdown anchor renderers render a\ndestinationless anchor as text instead of a dead link.\n\n`style/theme.css` changes are rewrapped shadow values and one declaration\nreorder. All 207 custom properties are unchanged, so the token contract with\ncloud-ui is untouched and this needs no paired change there.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsrrFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA42kQAGNzXqP4CqxGRrsPufESYE4o\nEkEpdbd/kOoHw+CXC+I5InoVt8JtpijavmrFVQJ/e8x+MA1fLWsZkoDWl59DSVaG\nK9rUMF8ZjhYXfjDYSsU+b17vJinDp1BZBmB/XsP0G0x+8MAeIvCT3JK4w6QWdmnk\n98ohIXFWBankbXUPRx9ASk2qovHk58M0S5OOpePiDsWF17LHy9N3M50bxuO7Y/04\n4G6zk/y5ybAlBkIpNdzt9+Cz1LPCuO7xjoj8QM9mabsMw5lbkrx1CKduS+4QB9EP\nGU0Of1gvYh9nq+EH59oeaQoNPBE0rtd5x6caeAWngYtG6RGdvExk+MBIA4DtG4j+\nz/cKIC4lqRD8M7QnKjH+ELr2jiJQyJ+3NTK4dubLpsqR2mJQrkIftDRqo0rUtUTe\nJs3fFhziR24TGpcz6ylBQN+rugsaWJx2VgRz2Sjb5si0Hcxsm6SUe3y1Q13ovis5\nmXvPsbfrviFXmJYBnScGB4mwtzqvgdhUyojldiarrzupNxz2O6/SSaJhF6KWVODh\nH4+oSXBXsGFjFjD0OUNrwNCDt1S78GSJh0I+gSm3Oo6ynpvgN45fbS7MBSIHFIJ9\nz8/vpRdozh8KGjPAEG9kudHA4wtq5oqIZLWBRojkdEoOpZZx6tK9HJFjQQwBsj19\nsAmNVLgXjzWMel/dp/t4\n=cub4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T17:28:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/2cf6ee101af76b0663d06faabbf0747a3950b698","node_id":"C_kwDODJ1vatoAKDJjZjZlZTEwMWFmNzZiMDY2M2QwNmZhYWJiZjA3NDdhMzk1MGI2OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/6c9f67343769597620f2fb6da439eed490affeae","sha":"6c9f67343769597620f2fb6da439eed490affeae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/6c9f67343769597620f2fb6da439eed490affeae"}],"sha":"2cf6ee101af76b0663d06faabbf0747a3950b698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/2cf6ee101af76b0663d06faabbf0747a3950b698"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879913?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SpicyPete","id":879913,"login":"SpicyPete","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTkxMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/06bf49d0884c0e587e70913831a49ec8c22ec6e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:54:10Z","email":"peter.zenger@redpanda.com","name":"Peter Zenger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:54:10Z","email":"peter.zenger@redpanda.com","name":"Peter Zenger"},"message":"frontend: keep a setting typed while a pipeline save is in flight, and stop promising a create never starts\n\nPost-merge review of #2624.\n\nThe settings stay editable while a save is in flight, but `markSaved` rebaselined\nthe form to the values on screen when the response landed. A name typed during the\nround trip became the saved default, so the form read clean, the unsaved-changes\nguard stood down and the recovery buffer was dropped. The baseline is now the\nsnapshot the request carried, and edits made since stay dirty. A save that\nnavigates unmounts the editor before the debounced write can run, so those edits\nare written as part of the save, against the target the editor continues on.\n\n`CreatePipeline` always deploys, so a create without drafts is a deploy followed by\na stop and cannot promise the pipeline never runs. The leave dialog said it creates\nthe pipeline \"without starting it\"; it now says it stops it afterwards and may run\nbriefly. A create response with no id skipped the stop but still reported the\npipeline as parked, which the surrounding comment already ruled out.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"407c6ef7839319195f1d664a022516fdb5118fac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/trees/407c6ef7839319195f1d664a022516fdb5118fac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/commits/06bf49d0884c0e587e70913831a49ec8c22ec6e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","s