mounted and the button goes invisible.\n- The expander button gets `aria-expanded`: the Registry sets it on the row,\n  and only for `expandRowByClick`, which these tables do not use.\n- The log column model was rebuilt five times a second by the 200ms poll;\n  it and the table options are memoized now.\n- The quick-search regex was compiled once per row per render; hoisted.\n- Icons come from `components/icons` where it aliases them — `XIcon` and\n  `CloseIcon` were the same lucide glyph imported twice under two names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(review): restore transform partition sorting\n\n* frontend: transforms — shared SearchInput, table parity with the legacy DataTable, logs column layout\n\n- New misc/search-input.tsx: leading icon, clear button that refocuses the field, click-through while empty, / to focus and Escape to clear — the Chakra SearchField contract the raw Input dropped. Used by both transforms search boxes.\n- Tables: the legacy DataTable paginated at 50 and hid the pager under 50 rows; restore that on the list and partition tables instead of 10-a-page with a permanent footer, or no pagination at all.\n- Logs table: the Registry ignores column sizes, so the Value column collapsed; hand it the slack and keep timestamps on one line. Rows are keyed by partition+offset so an expanded row follows its message; the URL page hook only fed an initialState TanStack reads once.\n- Dialog title clears the absolute close button; static snippets use SimpleCodeBlock instead of the async highlighter; the partition test resets the store inside act().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* frontend: transforms — final review\n\n- Setup page keeps the terminal look: SyncCodeBlock for the bash command (highlighted synchronously), DynamicCodeBlock for the listing; SimpleCodeBlock had dropped the highlighting.\n- Logs table shows no pager under its loading or empty row, as the legacy table.\n- SearchInput advertises its shortcuts (aria-keyshortcuts on the field, a title on the clear button).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* frontend: transforms — lint formatting\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* frontend: transforms — hiding off at table level\n\nenableHiding: false moves from every column into the tables'' shared options, so\na column added later cannot bring the header menu''s \"Hide\" item back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Beniamin Malinski <malinskibeniamin@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoIrvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApO4QABb8pgGRtzvMhVtNJAOtW57J\n9X8VB2Cldrh3OhXh4UnqpSjIY3vHJ3pc14N2HW3WFJ1FdZw3dsrwHEJMvBo++jLD\nqrmUlwYQMBJ6ffHpDmYQpS4EwXQEOALefj5JDuvJhN/rML0jle+UinGCZw/5LQgh\n2NBulkwHAxFfewdnlx1Pb7YL2SLsUcY5LKhHvGqDp74RqrThqkbHfrCZwDqn41FP\ncduw3JyZQcU7IpParvMExlfMfklNMtFJiu76D46uh0xjLszZAOgG8TyywMAlccyU\nogCxGru6zkaMs1GD4lfhDzcxw37zXj8WK6tIyvB4SHIteh931W4JXDpxsrVI7Jo/\nqLebeqizAa/Y2crrVb1iO0Otlb93+X3CNBBDMjXTemIk7ZHeGbhow8UupMVPJBmX\ngJRZUA8rfAg4cfVjsfFhCRjlidoYtx8QLBkgjDX97kq69nuq5hQYE59m60dHxfgZ\nG6UI28nl2XsQm0Z+XSEKfrFWRobet8LiEQwx8yfKSKY0Edpd2lNm0Dts0m05WC8t\nCTgaPNY63NIEfJKyPu7dH+z6pNaSHcuP4nrF5Wbtd5KUUUaiqiu1WRM3axI0j/1N\nUFZIa0bNeVVHrYp4dS5QTAhH0Ig9xIvphlxSg0ph6L0bCFLee5kKl5j4EE9Re5Ja\n5NlCM9QZFDyKdGPf0Jpl\n=3gDs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T22:23:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/0b2f23ff4b5211c162f002cc2587a0aebc43237e","node_id":"C_kwDODJ1vatoAKDBiMmYyM2ZmNGI1MjExYzE2MmYwMDJjYzI1ODdhMGFlYmM0MzIzN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/2c35c7061dace5b0abc99a1362965f2a1ba36f0b","sha":"2c35c7061dace5b0abc99a1362965f2a1ba36f0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/2c35c7061dace5b0abc99a1362965f2a1ba36f0b"}],"sha":"0b2f23ff4b5211c162f002cc2587a0aebc43237e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/0b2f23ff4b5211c162f002cc2587a0aebc43237e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1083817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jvorcak","id":1083817,"login":"jvorcak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODM4MTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/c250e826355b49e67c943bcc24a93827d22c81ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:52:37Z","email":"jan.vorcak@redpanda.com","name":"Ján Vorčák"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:52:37Z","email":"jan.vorcak@redpanda.com","name":"Ján Vorčák"},"message":"frontend: capture backend container output when e2e setup fails\n\nWhen the backend crashes during startup, testcontainers'' .start() throws\nand Ryuk reaps the container before docker logs can reach it — the crash\nreason was lost, leaving only \"(HTTP 409) container is not running\".\nStream the container''s output through withLogConsumer and dump the\nbuffer on failure. This is what surfaced the root cause of the current\nenterprise e2e failures (the rotated license''s string \"type\" field not\nparsing).","tree":{"sha":"ff51f35acf21bfe2bb6acc0f0b437ea64c9cdab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/trees/ff51f35acf21bfe2bb6acc0f0b437ea64c9cdab3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/commits/c250e826355b49e67c943bcc24a93827d22c81ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1083817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jvorcak","id":1083817,"login":"jvorcak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODM4MTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/c250e826355b49e67c943bcc24a93827d22c81ec","node_id":"C_kwDODJ1vatoAKGMyNTBlODI2MzU1YjQ5ZTY3Yzk0M2JjYzI0YTkzODI3ZDIyYzgxZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/6c31100ec93e61dc7bdc6bf1839d7523abcb1eed","sha":"6c31100ec93e61dc7bdc6bf1839d7523abcb1eed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/6c31100ec93e61dc7bdc6bf1839d7523abcb1eed"}],"sha":"c250e826355b49e67c943bcc24a93827d22c81ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/c250e826355b49e67c943bcc24a93827d22c81ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1083817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jvorcak","id":1083817,"login":"jvorcak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODM4MTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/6c31100ec93e61dc7bdc6bf1839d7523abcb1eed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:37:30Z","email":"jan.vorcak@redpanda.com","name":"Ján Vorčák"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:37:30Z","email":"jan.vorcak@redpanda.com","name":"Ján Vorčák"},"message":"Merge remote-tracking branch ''origin/master'' into UX-new-message-detail-page","tree":{"sha":"804fa7aeee899455d4c560741d92adb1c79ba889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/trees/804fa7aeee899455d4c560741d92adb1c79ba889"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/commits/6c31100ec93e61dc7bdc6bf1839d7523abcb1eed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1083817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jvorcak","id":1083817,"login":"jvorcak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODM4MTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvorcak","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/6c31100ec93e61dc7bdc6bf1839d7523abcb1eed","node_id":"C_kwDODJ1vatoAKDZjMzExMDBlYzkzZTYxZGM3YmRjNmJmMTgzOWQ3NTIzYWJjYjFlZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redpanda-data/console/commit/cf1c420f372c11854aafac360ca4de97765ed15b","sha":"cf1c420f372c11854aafac360ca4de97765ed15b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/cf1c420f372