","html_url":"https://github.com/SpicyPete","id":879913,"login":"SpicyPete","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTkxMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/626f35906f69acbfc835a5ee074cab4e6c97c3a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:23:27Z","email":"peter.zenger@redpanda.com","name":"Peter Zenger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:23:27Z","email":"peter.zenger@redpanda.com","name":"Peter Zenger"},"message":"Registry - update to 3.4.1 and add toast\n\nByte-for-byte pull from https://redpanda-ui-registry.netlify.app (v3.4.1,\nui-registry main 178dcb0c7). Of the 166 vendored files, 163 were already\nidentical; two changed and one is new:\n\n- data-table: `autoResetExpanded: false`, so an expanded subComponent row\n  survives a data refetch (TanStack v9 dropped v8''s one-shot guard).\n- stat: `StatGroup` gains `columns={6}`.\n- toast (new): Base UI toast with a module-level `toast` manager, so it can\n  be called outside React the way sonner and Chakra''s standalone toast can.\n  Precondition for the Chakra toast exit.\n\nNo call-site changes. No cssVars/css/tailwind payloads in any item, so a\ndirect file write is equivalent to the CLI pull. `[upstream]` marker count\nis 0 before and after. `@tanstack/react-table` stays at ^9.1.2 (registry\ndeclares ^9.2.3); `autoResetExpanded` exists in the installed table-core\nand type:check passes, so the range bump is deferred to avoid lockfile churn.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","