busercontent.com/u/879913?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SpicyPete","id":879913,"login":"SpicyPete","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTkxMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpicyPete","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/commits/878fd953ffa36976571649c7c1faaf763b350b33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T14:22:16Z","email":"879913+SpicyPete@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pete."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T14:22:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"frontend/rpcn: render field descriptions as prose, link each field to its docs (#2621)\n\n* RPCN description improements\n\n* Improving description rendering\n\n* field docs\n\n* Field doc links\n\n* improve descrtipion handling\n\n* frontend/rpcn: shrink the diff — fold docs context, drop cleanText\n\nReview pass aimed at PR size rather than behaviour.\n\n- Read the field docs URL off ResourceFieldContext (which already carries\n  component identity) instead of adding a provider. The extra JSX nesting\n  level had re-indented the whole form body: 296 changed lines -> 18.\n- Delete cleanText. markdownToPlainText(asciidocToMarkdown(x)) is\n  byte-identical on all 235 component summaries, its only render site, and\n  strictly better on descriptions, so the palette now uses that pair and\n  reuses the markdown it had already converted.\n- Consolidate tests without dropping assertions: table-driven cases for the\n  converter and getFieldDocsUrl, and three overlapping render tests merged.\n- Share one InlineHelp block between the short_description and\n  single-paragraph paths.\n\nDiff against master: 1107 changed lines -> 772.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fcddd78749d7b3b2aa872e09513576ccda387f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/trees/8fcddd78749d7b3b2aa872e09513576ccda387f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/commits/878fd953ffa36976571649c7c1faaf763b350b33","verification":{"payload":"tree 8fcddd78749d7b3b2aa872e09513576ccda387f7\nparent 9fc35c9cea83bf04767664a7ec23c2498eb0840c\nauthor Pete. <879913+SpicyPete@users.noreply.github.com> 1788358936 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788358936 -0700\n\nfrontend/rpcn: render field descriptions as prose, link each field to its docs (#2621)\n\n* RPCN description improements\n\n* Improving description rendering\n\n* field docs\n\n* Field doc links\n\n* improve descrtipion handling\n\n* frontend/rpcn: shrink the diff — fold docs context, drop cleanText\n\nReview pass aimed at PR size rather than behaviour.\n\n- Read the field docs URL off ResourceFieldContext (which already carries\n  component identity) instead of adding a provider. The extra JSX nesting\n  level had re-indented the whole form body: 296 changed lines -> 18.\n- Delete cleanText. markdownToPlainText(asciidocToMarkdown(x)) is\n  byte-identical on all 235 component summaries, its only render site, and\n  strictly better on descriptions, so the palette now uses that pair and\n  reuses the markdown it had already converted.\n- Consolidate tests without dropping assertions: table-driven cases for the\n  converter and getFieldDocsUrl, and three overlapping render tests merged.\n- Share one InlineHelp block between the short_description and\n  single-paragraph paths.\n\nDiff against master: 1107 changed lines -> 772.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmDEYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvNIQAHq1Ex+6XHG3ozLkOtOnmCmW\n9Ns2mh6jv2oLkQuxk4jVSW8f8DPl8rNrPGp2RGO+laaFBnrWcDevxLIN1k0ggyqp\nb9ceFmKrPmv3ienZTFBkWZb/OuoLXv89Yn8bzfG9jdZ9UhIL1eeapgIMcD/SK6+7\nerOIZ1Q7eW/IvBrghUT+w4iGvZDNWb7pAbu9E2ByKVl1JkSjctoxAr4j2PWd4XhK\nC6wglC44WS89G2zqRE3pLbn1eiqh6y7X4WWWryzq3lNHOdvVPO8A4dW+CSVz66WC\nXBysJRs1hpnHEFLdqstavlWul2+oOp4V3JMYo998hVcFUiNWnF9XGRmcfPAQO4hi\nNiqxfDFwqnOytVR3wabf3fx7ffMq6GHBB7gDkGIFN/Q+p/XiS2NUjRPKT+wBqq1c\n9Ajo1XjR3PER3V2ImMoLgkWWLARHuRgQEnMB5TmBu09c4HqyQNwPhFiNO+SOgzxd\n+r/KcaD6slyGx+xIfwlkI/d8MrvfXPO8A7uOgm3brue8KJlf1mFAcKNhSK6GUNx8\nHh0HA+a6QhHzgl4SXaHosbATB8FItgXt+Aw7lluyXfN9z3qMzBkYn8oRqgIJ5d5b\nNFcT+NPxQS22mxpYiRpI/3gKMf93LpsaZaJapHuudUlPQ0lmE77rhPkytqhBgWup\nrV7O1I5xJMzDtz+6SVy4\n=6JFe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T14:22:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":