13+SpicyPete@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pete."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:14:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(frontend): polish SQL studio toolbar and panel padding (#2622)\n\nReplace the Run button''s two boxed Kbd chips with a single quiet inline\nhint — the registry chip''s fill and border are meant for on-surface use\nand read as hollow boxes on the primary button.\n\nDrop the boxed card''s pt-3, which offset the catalog sidebar and query\ntab strip from the card''s top border; expanded mode never had it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"690469b3d04f9c29dde09ac3e75137d31b79508f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/trees/690469b3d04f9c29dde09ac3e75137d31b79508f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redpanda-data/console/git/commits/9fc35c9cea83bf04767664a7ec23c2498eb0840c","verification":{"payload":"tree 690469b3d04f9c29dde09ac3e75137d31b79508f\nparent 521b27c2859b05c184717b9fb66e3ce8f26dd189\nauthor Pete. <879913+SpicyPete@users.noreply.github.com> 1788344064 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788344064 +0000\n\nfix(frontend): polish SQL studio toolbar and panel padding (#2622)\n\nReplace the Run button''s two boxed Kbd chips with a single quiet inline\nhint — the registry chip''s fill and border are meant for on-surface use\nand read as hollow boxes on the primary button.\n\nDrop the boxed card''s pt-3, which offset the catalog sidebar and query\ntab strip from the card''s top border; expanded mode never had it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql/cACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQAoQAAcNCt/0XJ5uWgRxQwloK7D2\n7H4x45/SoRTnGUIcnb2v6scY+HeQchTc3PxBe8s6Nw5Oda+JueMnNOzcAfDVz7iy\nqkDDNw2EDShYr/oUf41YVRoS3VnORQ+k6DEZ6qiijyh3GDAmDMVDoaizLyeyCGII\nysHpxANTbhCiZ2mi18UBEtWBDbijm8Bj3VLJeBlcfz0lKQQc37gXao2fY6PTu9M3\nASme