thub.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/commits/c2ac034d5d13a817f85c678f63047e89aea19039/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:33Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a rootLoginNotification namespace container (#18)\n\nMove the root Query (rootLoginNotificationSettings) + root Mutation\n(rootLoginNotificationSaveSettings) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container,\nper the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    rootLoginNotificationSettings     -> rootLoginNotification { settings }\n- Mutation: rootLoginNotificationSaveSettings -> rootLoginNotification { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types RootLoginNotificationQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (the GqlSettings return type moves into the query holder); the\n*Extension classes keep a single rootLoginNotification accessor field.\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress\nfixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4d334053b27867f12f6b5980d9e68c0f06c3408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/a4d334053b27867f12f6b5980d9e68c0f06c3408"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/c2ac034d5d13a817f85c678f63047e89aea19039","verification":{"payload":"tree a4d334053b27867f12f6b5980d9e68c0f06c3408\nparent 2a285e146720080f98e4d27dcf3d6154a7003459\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782027033 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782027033 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a rootLoginNotification namespace container (#18)\n\nMove the root Query (rootLoginNotificationSettings) + root Mutation\n(rootLoginNotificationSaveSettings) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container,\nper the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    rootLoginNotificationSettings     -> rootLoginNotification { settings }\n- Mutation: rootLoginNotificationSaveSettings -> rootLoginNotification { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types RootLoginNotificationQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (the GqlSettings return type moves into the query holder); the\n*Extension classes keep a single rootLoginNotification accessor field.\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress\nfixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5MZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjaQQAJjYkJ/2ZAD8nt6s6nPfRHXw\n6U9T+2fLlvguUZ56flg2/aZzciPcjFo7oVS2U30Tj58k1yxGTv0dmxuEbKBaMlKb\nPoDY3fbVp7sbDKmpRs1wZKtV8mpezEe1/Tkp5JFBRN/ArNHg6TuQFGdz1ZZsvP86\nswCC1A0100ck2x/PDQRhAOrpf7HNOeEH66WRvWGmURMgyQcoOZRhep7H3bte92CQ\nworAfTW+uPxffgY8tyiMod5n/cJDtSGk1Deez3bmQid/2Uf4zpq5HedZtl7hN4Vy\nH6sxRt4DiFyaz+IOP+fBQesxOwYqhWEbAHxLfWJOaAAojjavml2S8JCV8/fldOnD\ncpo2fHPW8zxPxx