407aac4af2e82ae4cbb93c4033279b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/2a285e146720080f98e4d27dcf3d6154a7003459","verification":{"payload":"tree f344d773b4407aac4af2e82ae4cbb93c4033279b\nparent 19c58ae9adb7fea024df96fadb8647cb74c65e80\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781976705 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781976705 +0200\n\nrefactor: reduce saveSettings cognitive complexity; sort JSX props (#13)\n\n- Extract a putOrRemove helper in the GraphQL mutation so the four\n  set-when-non-empty / remove-when-empty config branches collapse to one-liners,\n  bringing cognitive complexity from 17 to under the 15 threshold (Sonar S3776).\n  Behavior is unchanged (empty value still removes the override → module default).\n- Auto-fix two react/jsx-sort-props lint errors in the admin panel.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNs6BCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4eoQACizEDZquZYJzyVPdaEL+WSa\nFly1Fea0TUr6ojkc9QPjxy0rOmGAx9ypDVAYUXQRslnB2ogFPzvqdR1bQlVjWQDs\nvUGYtOeLH06k7LJf5OIMsZC1B7gjD0FOLy92JOtpPI/9uf8CnIwBHcSRyiyWBwJr\nrT8N1Bt6DoCGUYE/NUdhUQTcMxbPet58lunKlvBuA1eFBxn355qySPMs+aw0TCZZ\nFeEFQrNJGvS8wqv0Vrm7h3jBfNBw+yh+ERdukWd652BWzXajhuI6m8nre/En0pUK\nmxb04EUXaKNODWRdaWSomt0QYvalM/uWL+W9vWrClkEHianik7VtnaIFWqbILhC0\n6wiN+b1a0KRGlHntyQJGrl++ywIqQOV1HmxdeM4HtKUrW6K9ZU2xfpUmQq/uH+tr\nCpUthYglevQehQYLdvxf/nOmcjw1betCNFPgb/2X7wfy62K4cdwMVmPBo9+sjX1/\n/90tYBvwYTDMQaDRP0VYFC792tBVZVVn2DT50P4A5RvC4sjBiT7HtzIfKrLK+Z2T\nutvCZ0Ds2YOhNs+wg+f8mx+PX6og8IjOvW9Ks1vS+d+4zjcgBjyPOi+8/CtpOH0e\nBBXqYg4LkUIarWk1Vd550BjPPn472lRVcG7hWEdbDY/pFz+FtbmPaw6bsgxjU2qe\n1zVmzdVreAme9vrBdoWa\n=1bNC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-20T17:31:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.