//api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/commits/19c58ae9adb7fea024df96fadb8647cb74c65e80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:07:18Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:07:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#12)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the fine-grained `rootLoginNotificationAdmin`\npermission so the gate cannot be silently removed or mismatched across the\nstack (GraphQL annotation, admin-route requiredPermission, and RBAC content).\n\n- Ship an assignable `root-login-notification-administrator` server role\n  (src/main/import/roles.xml) granting only `administrationAccess` +\n  `rootLoginNotificationAdmin` — no full `admin`. This lets the admin UI and\n  GraphQL API be delegated without granting server-wide administrator rights.\n- New Cypress spec 02-rootLoginNotification-Permissions.cy.ts with 4 tests:\n  * GraphQL: denies the gated `rootLoginNotificationSettings` query for a user\n    without the permission (asserts \"Permission denied\").\n  * GraphQL: allows the same read-only query for a user granted only the\n    module role, asserting full success (settings payload returned).\n  * Admin UI: hides the admin panel from the denied user.\n  * Admin UI: shows the panel to the allowed user (reuses the existing\n    \"Root Login Notification Settings\" panel assertion).\n- Bump module version 2.0.3-SNAPSHOT -> 2.0.4-SNAPSHOT so the new roles.xml\n  import content is re-imported on deploy.\n\nNo backend relaxation needed: the resolvers gate solely via\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"rootLoginNotificationAdmin\") (root-node ACL\ncheck) with no inner hardcoded `admin` check, so the role works end-to-end.\n\nValidated: ./ci.build.sh && ./ci.startup.sh -> 2/2 specs, 20/20 tests pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"214b104419527705c2a3b38ea402f76dcb404709","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/214b104419527705c2a3b38ea402f76dcb404709"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/19c58ae9adb7fea024df96fadb8647cb74c65e80","verification":{"payload":"tree 214b104419527705c2a3b38ea402f76dcb404709\nparent 23b92fbb202b08b7c394e7f5b87cd9c462ba29ea\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781118438 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781118438 +0200\n\ntest: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#12)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the fine-grained `rootLoginNotificationAdmin`\npermission so the gate cannot be silently removed or mismatched across the\nstack (GraphQL annotation, admin-route requiredPermission, and RBAC content).\n\n- Ship an assignable `root-login-notification-administrator` server role\n  (src/main/import/roles.xml) granting only `administrationAccess` +\n  `rootLoginNotificationAdmin` — no full `admin`. This lets the admin UI and\n  GraphQL API be delegated without granting server-wide administrator rights.\n- New Cypress spec 02-rootLoginNotification-Permissions.cy.ts with 4 tests:\n  * GraphQL: denies the gated `rootLoginNotificationSettings` query for a user\n    without the permission (asserts \"Permission denied\").\n  * GraphQL: allows the same read-only query for a user granted only the\n    module role, asserting full success (settings payload returned).\n  * Admin UI: hides the admin panel from the denied user.\n  * Admin UI: shows the panel to the allowed user (reuses the existing\n    \"Root Login Notification Settings\" panel assertion).\n- Bump module version 2.0.3-SNAPSHOT -> 2.0.4-SNAPSHOT so the new roles.xml\n  import content is re-imported on deploy.\n\nNo backend relaxation needed: the resolvers gate solely via\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"rootLoginNotificationAdmin\") (root-node ACL\ncheck) with no inner hardcoded `admin` check, so the role works end-to-end.\n\nValidated: ./ci.build.sh && ./ci.startup.sh -> 2/2 specs, 20/20 tests pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKbXmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5qgQAGbQ1WXiF9PKtdAcdKi5ycsd\nyHF/p3vleQNoQQsuJwwgjTWIDU/GmbEM68us7+GrwqQRIOWbj7qLOmKjHl5mX/q1\n99ZdN3Pupa9USHbWQb8mPmQgWI323MdDcUgDrp4aynRQyqclXtwmWIngIgj7Cn1Q\nft/1x8p0dIzlR6aFd59DSCadQqQbTCKcRHAGt95BGMnPdaJ1pevkaEE1H0r4m+2j\nTtiP/U4ILkIE19Y57vzpFIs3NyVXpSN8gK8e7Wwk0Lh6pRAx5/2UOIo4T59KeOSK\n959wlNAfKpwzRshjdl1poh/X0zQTzzVXjrqcbWj6/8AVerex8j5PZr3ugTMhnhVi\nUyTjXHSng51KqDXX+9Kr18HgpWW3KcnGXiSCvNIdTHuXuHg0KovLV0jPjMZq5chw\nGpF22z/BvzWNVg8hSNvG9W7uoAigjm0iLhNIydGq1EbWwDFfRULKAH+mAOGlPz1o\nkmz0/4SGYSO9JRqHNxpEoHwZ8kHb8g9n98zIc2JDkzvIiW8yLT0t1qvIYeDtOZIk\nMihQOJVjFLSv3IqCoiWgUQdyn5ZdLDNuoLfkGI5qcSTmy5zTWktlebGJTUL37U2l\nseXU7ADxdw/h4es/MUxnE4wbT4btAIRbeF81C+LLBCgsfZJPb8JqC0Eq2hapZCX/\nRj8LPnX8AmQgM2F5XPL2\n=FzOQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T19:07:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/root-login-notification/commit/19c58ae9adb7fea024df96fadb8647cb74c65e80","node_id":"C_kwDODKy7rNoAKDE5YzU4YWU5YWRiN2ZlYTAyNGRmOTZmYWRiODY0N2NiNzRjNjVlODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/root-login-notification/commit/23b92fbb202b08b7c394e7f5b87cd9c462ba29ea","sha":"23b92fbb202b08b7c394e7f5b87cd9c462ba29ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/commits/23b92fbb202b08b7c394e7f5b87cd9c462ba29ea"}],"sha":"19c58ae9adb7fea024df96fadb8647cb74c65e80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/commits/19c58ae9adb7fea024df96fadb8647cb74c65e80"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/commits/23b92fbb202b08b7c394e7f5b87cd9c462ba29ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:41:50Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:41:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add rootLoginNotificationAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC (#11)\n\n* feat: add rootLoginNotificationAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC\n\nIntroduce a module-specific JCR permission `rootLoginNotificationAdmin`\nas a child of the built-in `admin` permission so full admins continue to\nwork via JCR privilege inheritance.  Replace the generic `\"admin\"` value\nin both @GraphQLRequiresPermission annotations with the new fine-grained\npermission name, allowing the permission to be granted independently of\nfull admin rights.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: update requiredPermission to module-specific permission in frontend registration\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"179848a1893b812abf017decb5e3005e4ec9cae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/179848a1893b812abf017decb5e3005e4ec9cae2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/23b92fbb202b08b7c394e7f5b87cd9c462ba29ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 179848a1893b812abf017decb5e3005e4ec9cae2\nparent ef922ed696d8084d6f4993f97e5ca8d915ec072c\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781084510 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781084510 +0200\n\nfeat: add rootLoginNotificationAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC (#11)\n\n* feat: add rootLoginNotificationAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC\n\nIntroduce a module-specific JCR permission `rootLoginNotificationAdmin`\nas a child of the built-in `admin` permission so full admins continue to\nwork via JCR privilege inheritance.  Replace the generic `\"admin\"` value\nin both @GraphQLRequiresPermission annotations with the new fine-grained\npermission name, allowing the permission to be granted independently of\nfull admin rights.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: update requiredPermission to module-specific permission in frontend registration\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKTFeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAl6kQAJURAS/cOwG6QAM6GmuzismC\niGjF0AICcLkAyIv42qZ6lZWuVOysZkfD+owGOU24LGU0W0Vr9++keTOOD5KMzB7f\nfcIyqU2IAmZjMRQeSOsxROt7el4yb97i9dqIHpDHADfnVC5GWYiI2a9nSPKLjidP\n9XlSX0VPH8yf8L649setp+270azoGescG/gpZjsWiIEAT6qLbhXw91EdhAbZhreF\nYAxBAahtwErRXpsO1548j1crlLNnodCoM2bDL6l6FMJgp62cUKoOBsmm5CVg8N9g\nt3RFXFR/3wqkylnPIbITKCuGIDy0mqcGJ3b+VEA5ogpGo7CY83CPlfI5nwBKOzsx\nbn04nU48rrRQ/h7njoPpIwXx5PbR380wMnBrkpOXHQpwJTHTZYB1BvNLQIoeVaYK\nSZY1nt6KBvgP503VdGcQ6M9cCeZ+pyWdXlrewowLTkNf5NkENCsQ0sJdpa/qsw/S\nIbaZ/lQvQ5JUpxvh/4cExB3q5FLIMQj9rk8Nn1iLIGNxjRMnwbGDAz4zcKGuX8qP\n+y3+9sazcefMdQb21GyiPpAzGVvBkmTlwc+kEM9Lr+UUcpWA2fNpbhVh+PtBGaHq\nJAxDLf22Y7rPAmJ4moWvKG9YRonDJwLl08NbpVt0dcr4sNg/Y97Cg8/8/Tqe+N8w\nBrppXUEvPgbhj6HEBdTI\n=T47Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T09:41:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs"