rl":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/commits/e135e6e789088ee3b297917c007c35f88a2bdf0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T07:03:41Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T07:03:41Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: consume richtext-ckeditor5 remote as richtextCkeditor5\n\nThe richtext-ckeditor5 module renamed its Module Federation container\nglobal from appShell.remotes.ckeditor5 to appShell.remotes.richtextCkeditor5\n(beta-3+ / 1.0.1). The stale ''ckeditor5'' mapping resolved to undefined at\nruntime, so the CKEditor remote was skipped, the admin route never\nregistered, and the settings panel rendered blank — failing all admin-UI\nCypress specs. Align the remote name with the current richtext-ckeditor5.\n\nValidated: admin-UI E2E now fully green (root-login 16/16, jcr-account 15/15).\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"09d49e7d2088aac8a97148bbbe7f75443a10bd76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/09d49e7d2088aac8a97148bbbe7f75443a10bd76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/e135e6e789088ee3b297917c007c35f88a2bdf0d","verification":{"payload":"tree 09d49e7d2088aac8a97148bbbe7f75443a10bd76\nparent 85e8508c19d2f767f5aa1eeb6642784e1e37ffd4\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780815821 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780815821 +0200\n\nfix: consume richtext-ckeditor5 remote as richtextCkeditor5\n\nThe richtext-ckeditor5 module renamed its Module Federation container\nglobal from appShell.remotes.ckeditor5 to appShell.remotes.richtextCkeditor5\n(beta-3+ / 1.0.1). The stale ''ckeditor5'' mapping resolved to undefined at\nruntime, so the CKEditor remote was skipped, the admin route never\nregistered, and the settings panel rendered blank — failing all admin-UI\nCypress specs. Align the remote name with the current richtext-ckeditor5.\n\nValidated: admin-UI E2E now fully green (root-login 16/16, jcr-account 15/15).\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmolF80ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mj9Af/RHsu+HdZ58lia4VSSbwQf1uZ7HQXj7LQw/tYGVLSguF2CnlrUX3bH4Ue\nRK6iaUzTV0cJnNLXioDRve7YwZeGb9hUfumGeiLj3LVkcHnV9ES0T0XNFdk3q0VQ\nuYLHRnvXk+BwlZehcJnqqNehuxPjTYDwPeqB97VWCCfX4b2IIf6viHATGpeYviJp\ncrcbN1U0LZkDQGn4lM826TCa3btE1D0REseW21gWKL7CGp9jftjd/b4QLpAsoshS\nTGoU3AR2p+sCGUmo54LJefSdJNEzrY7R4cUm1eAar9/a5W3Qk2wvvv71kL6o5SiW\nUnLUNtihk5N+MPiE8c5OhSkZKa6jjg==\n=0mZ9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:38:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap