tter":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:44:15Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: persist empty subject/body as removal; redact email from error messages\n\n- When subject or body are empty/null they are now removed from the config\n  dictionary so the updated() handler falls back to the built-in defaults,\n  making the behaviour explicit and consistent with recipient/sender.\n  A DEBUG log line records the removal.\n- Remove raw recipient/sender values from IllegalArgumentException messages\n  to avoid leaking user-supplied email addresses in server logs.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"716655bfe148b59bbadc118fa63bfabb59a2cc2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/716655bfe148b59bbadc118fa63bfabb59a2cc2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/85e8508c19d2f767f5aa1eeb6642784e1e37ffd4","verification":{"payload":"tree 716655bfe148b59bbadc118fa63bfabb59a2cc2c\nparent 8cdbd5f8f687fab10cd8f25ef648d096427371e3\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749855 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749855 +0200\n\nfix: persist empty subject/body as removal; redact email from error messages\n\n- When subject or body are empty/null they are now removed from the config\n  dictionary so the updated() handler falls back to the built-in defaults,\n  making the behaviour explicit and consistent with recipient/sender.\n  A DEBUG log line records the removal.\n- Remove raw recipient/sender values from IllegalArgumentException messages\n  to avoid leaking user-supplied email addresses in server logs.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFh8ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3klkAgAjOCtBd1MQNIqr4cUCHZi5Nb49H7UE+JtDI7KOMs/F/J73BTUFhAnu1Ef\nS6Ba+eUj5p+G3c926ILh/JCwXexjhGq4HLrXc9g7ou5gEnlhL03tnV2Jkh