/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/commits/8cdbd5f8f687fab10cd8f25ef648d096427371e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:43:59Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:43:59Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: make config fields volatile to prevent data race\n\nupdated() is called from an OSGi ConfigurationAdmin thread while\nonEvent() reads the fields from a Jahia event-dispatch thread.\nMarking all four fields volatile provides the required memory-visibility\nguarantee without requiring heavier synchronization.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"81732b73a456ffd681c308cbffcce6ab961ce734","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/81732b73a456ffd681c308cbffcce6ab961ce734"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/8cdbd5f8f687fab10cd8f25ef648d096427371e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 81732b73a456ffd681c308cbffcce6ab961ce734\nparent f523dc7e2a50318c4f9e9bde8c856a7c2184045e\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749839 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749839 +0200\n\nfix: make config fields volatile to prevent data race\n\nupdated() is called from an OSGi ConfigurationAdmin thread while\nonEvent() reads the fields from a Jahia event-dispatch thread.\nMarking all four fields volatile provides the required memory-visibility\nguarantee without requiring heavier synchronization.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFg8ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3ko3Af+PedUIMsvlO89POyV/cn5/EVlkuJvHZeQhEX6al7FF+FdSi4dGP471nxi\nrVAbbjMseqJLDrUVzjTgvzC20gThXD1rotVf1VyTBPDP+O/hLJG/RZHjJYG/oMzc\nIYzX5dOHEnftm/Gjt8QwRoG9oZbZnLb+y0/V8KdT6a6XmWjX4U8Um0m40hj2Q83O\nDSr8T5rsPIe99Q9ujhFmGlGM//yjWbYWfDWulcfuvZ9GiylHToClXu6SVoQxoVLX\nQSHUktdmIghj/mAcy+ZOMutCbIboakAhannuDP4ico6ODnqCAwbGaaiJF6dxlq4i\nGt8FqFD3nvAavkV9mOtA9ZRDDwP2UQ==\n=fcQE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:38:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/s