3:48Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: remove production debug console.log from index.js bootstrap\n\nThe console.log(res) call leaked the entire app-shell bootstrap object to\nthe browser console in production. console.debug calls in init.js are\nintentional developer tracing and are left unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccf216e75c24c468c605ebe8750c09f1e29bb349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/ccf216e75c24c468c605ebe8750c09f1e29bb349"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/f523dc7e2a50318c4f9e9bde8c856a7c2184045e","verification":{"payload":"tree ccf216e75c24c468c605ebe8750c09f1e29bb349\nparent 1c99848fae360e7e492981eb81a14a8188586223\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749828 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749828 +0200\n\nfix: remove production debug console.log from index.js bootstrap\n\nThe console.log(res) call leaked the entire app-shell bootstrap object to\nthe browser console in production. console.debug calls in init.js are\nintentional developer tracing and are left unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFgQACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3l5bgf/XG5/+MW/IczGpVhM43wSMt62FnlToh5A4y0DVdV24PpQ25hAcJ+S00iP\nJ+3wrnLwNtxUkZqeyxsydZcFJHUal/jriePs81rAx1mNmBi2G11dpPR8BpkHXCGU\nTvDmg8Yac1NA9fWmAhqumjTP6LbiXVP6fg7iEOsOlc8rkC0YodRb/J1zqM49VQ2A\n9JSLhNkIKFIzbpzQ8fI+NUaInQbUgGj6uNVXl1vyWqH2GmNDNqe1WazQnBlv4k/6\nWiIzYz/PaGdSoTsmyr0zHuAgPYJroq0d2NZEXt5dzRpGJj/ZoOeqAZ75x+DDhcW+\nOzgeGelYgy56aTb9Wqm/AUEcjVHGNw==\n=vVBh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:38:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/e