ents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/commits/ef4aa61c9084233bc03b6c93a0305067188a6fb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T13:29:48Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T13:29:48Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Sanitize user-controlled inputs in root-login notification email\n\nPrevent CRLF header injection in the mail subject and HTML/XSS\ninjection in the body by:\n- Trimming x-forwarded-for to the first hop\n- Restricting server name and client IP to a safe host charset\n- Stripping control characters from the site request parameter\n- HTML-escaping the IP and time tokens inserted into the HTML body\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"addebd59b88ca7f1a5171092ba5e0f47bc17cd55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/addebd59b88ca7f1a5171092ba5e0f47bc17cd55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/ef4aa61c9084233bc03b6c93a0305067188a6fb4","verification":{"payload":"tree addebd59b88ca7f1a5171092ba5e0f47bc17cd55\nparent dd81b2f8239f92667fe5ae79a2d8752dca3ca887\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778938188 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778938188 +0200\n\nSanitize user-controlled inputs in root-login notification email\n\nPrevent CRLF header injection in the mail subject and HTML/XSS\ninjection in the body by:\n- Trimming x-forwarded-for to the first hop\n- Restricting server name and client IP to a safe host charset\n- Stripping control characters from the site request parameter\n- HTML-escaping the IP and time tokens inserted into the HTML body\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoIcUwACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nnKAf9F+uMTHEHTkYfWVHOylQ3r6A7b1eK5vc+Xdkg1FmwXElZuav80kXkfDEE\nmFMCpEPKewc/DbP6EX88m58QlrQXUQCT7taKrgCm05dPFiDirCHkhATjyYajAvwX\nIyBhy9VzO5cvZ2sG+eJhQBvVYw4OVhcpEJ/P78YwQdpoPfP8PIwSuBdoIXGrhyOj\n223pensWlaY5TvOrxWgdffG4ynOCRbgl6wnW5BCi3DkC4UUwk+ciocjkPSYzyHSS\nEW5tS3ujSixTqOHGLyCMANIDVMqnzpkmK7DOtGKD9utEWtSg9+iwFp3gYBmcFMlL\nMP+faojWEsAyOit5vwlHpKgEAnO3Vw==\n=Cc08\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T11:06:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/root-login-notification/commit/ef4aa61c9084233bc03b6c93a0305067188a6fb4","node_id":"C_kwDODKy7rNoAKGVmNGFhNjFjOTA4NDIzM2JjMDNiNmM5M2EwMzA1MDY3MTg4YTZmYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/root-login-notification/commit/dd81b2f8239f92667fe5ae7