apper div —\nonReady sets labels directly on the contenteditable; keeping both causes\ndouble-label announcement\n\nM-02: correct success alert border from #4caf50 (~2.3:1) to #388e3c (~4.1:1)\nagainst #e8f5e9 background — #4caf50 still failed SC 1.4.11 (3:1 required)\n\nM-06: add width: 100% + box-sizing: border-box to .rln_container to prevent\noverflow on viewports narrower than 700px\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"8605d664bb0635790e0612f12fe3480ea36ca72b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/8605d664bb0635790e0612f12fe3480ea36ca72b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/dd81b2f8239f92667fe5ae79a2d8752dca3ca887","verification":{"payload":"tree 8605d664bb0635790e0612f12fe3480ea36ca72b\nparent a4cb2ffd94944fde636a7574789eb7ddd1e4c51f\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778841219 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778841219 +0200\n\nfix(a11y): accessibility-lead follow-up — 4 corrections\n\nM-03: drop aria-required=\"true\" on recipient and sender inputs — native\nrequired attribute already signals mandatory field to AT; using both produces\nredundant announcements in NVDA+Chrome\n\nC-03/M-04: remove role=\"group\" + aria-labelledby from CKEditor wrapper div —\nonReady sets labels directly on the contenteditable; keeping both causes\ndouble-label announcement\n\nM-02: correct success alert border from #4caf50 (~2.3:1) to #388e3c (~4.1:1)\nagainst #e8f5e9 background — #4caf50 still failed SC 1.4.11 (3:1 required)\n\nM-06: add width: 100% + box-sizing: border-box to .rln_container to prevent\noverflow on viewports narrower than 700px\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoG9oMACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3l/ogf/RzTkPqQU7a/luB0chydmBfxoqbdgzmHfH5WlvzA3Ftid5KRfhp4hFB30\nB7GWilozQVCajvi5a0s+tzGQ48M51UE