ars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/commits/a4cb2ffd94944fde636a7574789eb7ddd1e4c51f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:31:17Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:31:17Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(a11y): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA issues — C-01 to C-03, M-01 to M-06, N-02, N-04\n\nC-01 (SC 4.1.3): replace single dynamic-role live region with two fixed-role\nregions: role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" for success, role=\"alert\"\naria-live=\"assertive\" for error — AT registers live region role at mount\n\nC-02 (SC 4.1.3): remove setSaveStatus(null) before await in handleSave —\nflushing empty string before await resolves drops the final announcement\n\nC-03 (SC 1.3.1, 4.1.2): remove aria-hidden=\"false\" (WAI-ARIA spec violation\non visible elements); add onReady callback to set aria-labelledby and\naria-describedby directly on the CKEditor contenteditable DOM node\n\nM-01 (SC 2.4.7): remove setTimeout focus call to 1×1px live region — focus\nnaturally stays on Save button after click\n\nM-02 (SC 1.4.1, 1.4.11): increase alert border contrast — success border\n#a5d6a7 (1.9:1) → #4caf50 (4.5:1); error border #ef9a9a (2.1:1) → #f44336 (5.1:1)\n\nM-03 (SC 3.3.2, 4.1.2): add required + aria-required=\"true\" to recipient and\nsender inputs; asterisk visual indicator in labels with sr-only \"(required)\" text\n\nM-04 (SC 1.3.1): add role=\"group\" to CKEditor wrapper div so aria-labelledby\nis honoured by assistive technology\n\nM-05 (SC 2.4.3): add skip link targeting #rln-main to let keyboard users bypass\nheader and description; visible on focus, off-screen otherwise\n\nM-06 (SC 1.4.4): input width px → min(420px, 100%) for reflow at 200% zoom;\neditor width 700px → width:100% max-width:700px; padding px → rem\n\nN-02 (SC 2.4.2): restore previous document.title on component unmount\n\nN-04 (SC 1.3.5): add autocomplete=\"off\" to subject field\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9653b62ccb5bb8a2cb674d0ce8d065b91a4d8f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/trees/b9653b62ccb5bb8a2cb674d0ce8d065b91a4d8f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/root-login-notification/git/commits/a4cb2ffd94944fde636a7574789eb7ddd1e4c51f","verification":{"payload":"tree b9653b62ccb5bb8a2cb674d0ce8d065b91a4d8f1\nparent 55ac5b25480b017b89a2d1bc1102985cf918eb5f\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778841077 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778841077 +0200\n\nfix(a11y): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA issues — C-01 to C-03, M-01 to M-06, N-02, N-04\n\nC-01 (SC 4.1.3): replace single dynamic-role live region with two fixed-role\nregions: role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" for success, role=\"alert\"\naria-live=\"assertive\" for error — AT registers live region role at mount\n\nC-02 (SC 4.1.3): remove setSaveStatus(null) before await in handleSave —\nflushing empty string before await resolves drops the final announcement\n\nC-03 (SC 1.3.1, 4.1.2): remove aria-hidden=\"false\" (WAI-ARIA spec violation\non visible elements); add onReady callback to set aria-labelledby and\naria-describedby directly on the CKEditor contenteditable DOM node\n\nM-01 (SC 2.4.7): remove setTimeout focus call to 1×1px live region — focus\nnaturally stays on Save button after click\n\nM-02 (SC 1.4.1, 1.4.11): increase alert border contrast — success border\n#a5d6a7 (1.9:1) → #4caf50 (4.5:1); error border #ef9a9a (2.1:1) → #f44336 (5.1:1)\n\nM-03 (SC 3.3.2, 4.1.2): add required + aria-required=\"true\" to recipient and\nsender inputs; asterisk visual indicator in labels with sr-only \"(required)\" text\n\nM-04 (SC 1.3.1): add role=\"group\" to CKEditor wrapper div so aria-labelledby\nis honoured by assistive technology\n\nM-05 (SC 2.4.3): add skip link targeting #rln-main to let keyboard users bypass\nheader and description; visible on focus, off-screen otherwise\n\nM-06 (SC 1.4.4): input width px → min(420px, 100%) for reflow at 200% zoom;\neditor width 700px → width:100% max-width:700px; padding px → rem\n\nN-02 (SC 2.4.2): restore previous document.title on component unmount\n\nN-04 (SC 1.3.5): add autocomplete=\"off\" to subject field\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoG9fUACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lt3Qf8C0VJRmN3JqEjqNSzWtzxgaoP8NwvjRxZpRM0DPDyQGUaZhikHBvgiNOt\nRXO8ck+GHatNsb4TioUXcfZfP9vYwnCWqigMcKahBglHKn1SMuXiA+wUUwSbVjZr\n6cuuPfGHLdZqQ24nCjvy+ETQaF317qgHoEGnBqd45em6rhpkuOTLZidBTulcGrGj\nb0GzqIlSQvuUaFsak0vXjO4gHIkOFUykpxfgKnwwT5SdxkVHWh6T0vi7Jbhoiefz\nB27uRQC1UpSdzkfJs7HSHI8An2z6vv/YBdPtDsFrpe74Kjd2PFikyE2XYNPoyx54\n5V+7RwHnaNlt5LazXXrJmz6UFCJNQQ==\n=HIYw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T10:42:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.