 load the buffer stub with strategy beforeInteractive, matching the hooks example. Gatsby: inject the stub inline into the SSR head via onRenderBody instead of onClientEntry, which ran after the client bundle loaded.\n\nRefs rudderlabs/rudderstack-gtm-template#6","tree":{"sha":"b367e453c3e354fa8ccefcb13ba59f83a168b73f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rudderlabs/rudder-sdk-js/git/trees/b367e453c3e354fa8ccefcb13ba59f83a168b73f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rudderlabs/rudder-sdk-js/git/commits/f01f674cd6061719eacdce05947a2b0fd14e3440","verification":{"payload":"tree b367e453c3e354fa8ccefcb13ba59f83a168b73f\nparent ce0b4acce5bcfdc67f829965e42821d8566b40e1\nauthor Sai Kumar Battinoju <88789928+saikumarrs@users.noreply.github.com> 1791295548 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791295548 +0530\n\nfix(examples): set up SDK buffer before GTM tags (#3269)\n\nNext.js js/ts: load the buffer stub with strategy beforeInteractive, matching the hooks example. Gatsby: inject the stub inline into the SSR head via onRenderBody instead of onClientEntry, which ran after the client bundle loaded.\n\nRefs rudderlabs/rudderstack-gtm-template#6","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxQA8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkwsQAEtvdKinTM04liakKabZi+qv\nHl8Tc6gV4eVYPT4QEhy+VDCm5YzqZdAFFs9KFIhHHaXdnwjI34l8ddgWHZrr1+KJ\n2IKqy3iSurA9ju7wrx9ODc7bmTdXO+ci3aDTh5B9jTtrJq5/q5HSUTtAo0HdZEuv\nkwkggyMXuLYEU9lHkmCHVCZD0XgSSPj4NOHOEX7XPY9V3fdi6xFyJegHnGfbmPFe\nFeGhvAYBF1yrixD5wf9B4haKzAsB92EGLo2W6VMhbNbqeCa0hF7GtMNirHnEq2U1\nid16tXo82v0xbDGbHnwAN1OWILy+22XXHMaaJRDZ7viHDJwJRoTaCucNXugpNO3f\nUUtIUYzgJ9Nth3/8yd8fvA1S2P947UIYaPh0TsDOnPygmrEmFFY0rLwjHQxQZ79+\nbdhRiP5J1Q1ED6E6iXV4Kfvi4S8q3sRW6hn/k8rNzDKj1I8EdJGps3iX7fLShsb9\n0vY9HaPCsrrtYnkdTaaeLChpMua7YRvGeZTK72QJP6w/phflvt2Z0QBlsFznoslb\nKi8c1HyaeFsLmd3prXiVGqCLxrS8/3lkuu9rka8XnAPHPyPBiAPlYRgGFZTJ2wbz\nipfQNqif718V4Ul/O7XReb7GsV8F+aqjDTIlnKBTcTcb+XTXNPABKIO3vAUgq59g\nFi3ohYMP96G7O6TkgNGP\n=EsOm\n-----END PGP SIGNATUR