st_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saikumarrs","id":88789928,"login":"saikumarrs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4Nzg5OTI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saikumarrs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saikumarrs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saikumarrs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saikumarrs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saikumarrs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saikumarrs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rudderlabs/rudder-sdk-js/commits/ce0b4acce5bcfdc67f829965e42821d8566b40e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:05:00Z","email":"88789928+saikumarrs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sai Kumar Battinoju"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:05:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(analytics-js): compile the CDN modern core for the snippet''s floor (#3264)\n\nperf(analytics-js): target probe floor on CDN core\n\nThe CDN modern core is only ever served by the loading snippet, whose\nfeature probe admits Chrome/Edge 80, Firefox 74 and Safari/iOS 14 and\nup. Compiling it for the browserslist floor (Chrome 63, from\n`supports es6-module-dynamic-import`) down-levels `?.` and `??` for\nengines that never receive it.\n\nThe CDN modern core build now passes those versions to Babel as\nexplicit targets. npm builds and the remote plugin chunks keep the\nbrowserslist floor: npm consumers pick the build at bundle time with no\nprobe, and the plugin chunks they fetch from the CDN skip their bundler\n(SDK-5495).\n\nCDN modern core: 35.7 KB -> 33.9 KB gzip. npm modern builds and plugin\nchunks are byte-identical.","tree":{"sha":"80e931bf7671c78f47a0392840ec5d55b7b3525b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rudderlabs/rudder-sdk-js/git/trees/80e931bf7671c78f47a0392840ec5d55b7b3525b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rudderlabs/rudder-sdk-js/git/commits/ce0b4acce5bcfdc67f829965e42821d8566b40e1","verification":{"payload":"tree 80e931bf7671c78f47a0392840ec5d55b7b3525b\nparent 8c0a41ff448be06ff5fc6a392df9e65a5fb0ca82\nauthor Sai Kumar Battinoju <88789928+saikumarrs@users.noreply.github.com> 1791187500 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791187500 +0530\n\nperf(analytics-js): compile the CDN modern core for the snippet''s floor (#3264)\n\nperf(analytics-js): target probe floor on CDN core\n\nThe CDN modern core is only ever served by the loading snippet, whose\nfeature probe admits Chrome/Edge 80, Firefox 74 and Safari/iOS 14 and\nup. Compiling it for the browserslist floor (Chrome 63, from\n`supports es6-module-dynamic-import`) down-levels `?.` and `??` for\nengines that never receive it.\n\nThe CDN modern core build now passes those versions to Babel as\nexplicit targets. npm builds and the remote plugin chunks keep the\nbrowserslist floor: npm consumers pick the build at bundle time with no\nprobe, and the plugin chunks they fetch from the CDN skip their bundler\n(SDK-5495).\n\nCDN modern core: 35.7 KB -> 33.9 KB gzip. npm modern builds and plugin\nchunks are byte-identical.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw1osCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJDsQAIqHScFAq84O5Pg1MO3Az6Fp\nUOD5Ng6uBNQcxqdn/XfTFPBxV2mf8UbWnN+hTl/54S4A/mQMdjNYKr89g43ooZD+\nE/JSsrrFWPZpVORaBXftx9e7p6Tc5WG3CCh7Ys4Kcu4MA+CUfeDfyPm8y53B0EM+\n8DCdKSCDY7DMHTbZBCVfepxnmHhtmJe1+q4cqE6+ZiTuGMGPnUDgSar96xPd9Mey\niEDvjMmcemPzSApw1a7Tr+mMdBd/XFX9AlhynGyqo0GlYOmMre3cGAGJSDjjhlCP\nOMqs8U7v+TW4RdhrIyCb4Kt+UoPVVv7ywCLWhpdGHRFpSfIJSKuhqIGjkWP0+d7V\n4jt7ydL4GkDMmSYJKtMUcHVuaQsemBFMg9f0BPgHND/S+nWDf0kzfVRt/uVv7nOC\nMlyFdXJ+RIjqUgoZrJqeZDZQbtlG7rud1SbOL1/KWI3f3YBUnhiq/7nPtypsdhR4\nxNL/161zFzStS72A5PJCyNqoaA3tns6aezBpqfDpcJKuTJP8l9gIksAu6kpQu8FQ\n2YFY26PkV+Vv05Ws7ZT8sAjFhoyedUTTdgh1EIZRUcQ3uljPcG152gEIjYAct4lF\nwwtn3OYYoE2pANbd+jdYE4lnAhparbQGUrNXNDF8daQyoz3FBPkH