ithub.com/nodeca/js-yaml), [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping), [fast-uri](https://github.com/fastify/fast-uri) and [qs](https://github.com/ljharb/qs).\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 5 updates in the /examples/angular/sample-app directory:\n\n| Package | From | To |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [js-yaml](https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml) | `4.1.1` | `4.3.2` |\n| [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping) | `2.9.19` | `2.11.24` |\n| [fast-uri](https://github.com/fastify/fast-uri) | `3.1.2` | `3.1.8` |\n| [hono](https://github.com/honojs/hono) | `4.12.18` | `4.13.8` |\n| [immutable](https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js) | `5.1.5` | `5.1.9` |\n\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 7 updates in the /examples/gatsby/sample-gatsby-plugin-usage directory:\n\n| Package | From | To |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [js-yaml](https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml) | `3.14.2` | `3.15.2` |\n| [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping) | `2.9.18` | `2.11.24` |\n| [fast-uri](https://github.com/fastify/fast-uri) | `3.1.2` | `3.1.8` |\n| [colord](https://github.com/omgovich/colord) | `2.9.3` | `2.10.0` |\n| [joi](https://github.com/hapijs/joi) | `17.13.3` | `17.13.8` |\n| [multer](https://github.com/expressjs/multer) | `2.1.1` | `2.4.0` |\n| [svgo](https://github.com/svg/svgo) | `2.8.2` | `2.8.4` |\n\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 5 updates in the /examples/gatsby/sample-gatsby-site directory:\n\n| Package | From | To |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [js-yaml](https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml) | `3.14.2` | `3.15.2` |\n| [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping) | `2.9.18` | `2.11.24` |\n| [colord](https://github.com/omgovich/colord) | `2.9.3` | `2.10.0` |\n| [joi](https://github.com/hapijs/joi) | `17.13.3` | `17.13.8` |\n| [multer](https://github.com/expressjs/multer) | `2.1.1` | `2.4.0` |\n\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 3 updates in the /examples/integrations/Ninetailed/sample-apps/app-using-npm directory: [js-yaml](https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml), [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping) and [colord](https://github.com/omgovich/colord).\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 3 updates in the /examples/integrations/Ninetailed/sample-apps/app-using-v1.1-cdn directory: [js-yaml](https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml), [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping) and [colord](https://github.com/omgovich/colord).\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 3 updates in the /examples/integrations/Ninetailed/sample-apps/app-using-v3-cdn directory: [js-yaml](https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml), [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping) and [colord](https://github.com/omgovich/colord).\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 4 updates in the /examples/nextjs/hooks/sample-app directory: [@humanfs/node](https://github.com/humanwhocodes/humanfs/tree/HEAD/packages/node), [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping), [sharp](https://github.com/lovell/sharp) and [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js).\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 4 updates in the /examples/nextjs/js/sample-app directory: [@humanfs/node](https://github.com/humanwhocodes/humanfs/tree/HEAD/packages/node), [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping), [sharp](https://github.com/lovell/sharp) and [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js).\nBumps the npm_and_yarn group with 4 updates in the /examples/nextjs/page-router/sample-app directory: [@humanfs/node](https://github.com/humanwhocodes/humanfs/tree/HEAD/packages/node), [baseline-browser-mapping](https://github.com/web-platform-dx/baseline-browser-mapping), [sharp](https://github.com/lovell/sharp) and [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js).\nBumps the