ted in `legacyJSEngineRequiredPolyfills`, so it\nwould throw in the legacy bundle. `getTopDomain` is unrelated to this change\nanyway, so it goes back to index access and the file no longer touches it.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Denis Ciccale <539546+dciccale@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoBfjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxHoQAHqlqta2eh1iJle7z5onukqN\nFlQjgiprYzTEoZGPEoxeoNA47v6LNgd8+W2+7TMxCjlG+4MPg3G0MjyX3XM6bFMs\nRJ7DGCRFMuVJsXC3afMKOIXDe1vXVOHL1UWEG0G+9aIhTmmA5wqeRUkFikSGJsp9\nJjePuL83sHLcEOi2sZ65/AQi5zyA+JAeoynEj+QrfvgVw4dAAN21W9mlEjKojv5f\nS9+eDUUY4M1uSbJ5eE5eaLHzq8Z95E7lUJwtVD4aF2PaQ8Tnt/UxBLflVtLcBWrD\nVbP6iPKpY0kYfzYDuX9GWzwqrm540HODJQBiIAaOfnq1JThYBl6D1QOW4W9dvwbP\nGKyGfFKimb8ffdLsisrL7j8spZSmSt8QczpAmMhmjada1lwXkpZcx7HPysmbb/2G\nhUENHkfBXQ7qEkbN/ivbaN+tCeyjWgq5ENBgwVDk+DXsV/RSKdaGzjdJ4RfF5xxE\ncIsw6JsgznDcopVci/GzCLz1zODs3equc4sO6lVAIadgukAPbZzF3mbYqQNNPfPk\n4k9y9zqOXD7ta2TVSt2EMuds3ACGiVmtJIEhVkeA7Vnb4/D5GQaSQiliLvE3P9Eh\n1curH113XAXA3ze6E3MUMD9Hd5cA7dj1JBp5kMP68jmPwt7adBjvImGVRjgzgkuv\n9Ay0WD29eLqc5nT/nNDz\n=RdYc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T14:12:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"