ithub.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/5c6b51879e88066db28710af3df1af7f2fea71d2","sha":"5c6b51879e88066db28710af3df1af7f2fea71d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/5c6b51879e88066db28710af3df1af7f2fea71d2"}],"sha":"94ec036a77fd32f8e9593d2f51a1b7dcb826e6b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/94ec036a77fd32f8e9593d2f51a1b7dcb826e6b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/5c6b51879e88066db28710af3df1af7f2fea71d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:22Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a bruteForceLoginProtection namespace container (#42)\n\n* refactor: nest GraphQL operations under bruteForceLoginProtection namespace container\n\nMove the 8 root Query and 9 root Mutation flat fields (bruteForceLoginProtection*)\nunder a single hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention\n(one Query/Mutation field returning a <Module> type, operations nested inside).\n\n- Query:    bruteForceLoginProtectionGlobalSettings -> bruteForceLoginProtection { globalSettings }, etc.\n- Mutation: bruteForceLoginProtectionSaveJail       -> bruteForceLoginProtection { saveJail }, etc.\n\nNew holder types BruteForceLoginProtectionQuery/Mutation carry the operations as\ninstance @GraphQLField methods; the *Extension classes keep a single accessor field.\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf, so authorization is unchanged.\nFrontend gql.js + tabs and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep for the new schema.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* test: fix Cypress harness — replace Yarn-Berry-only resolutions with classic-compatible lockfile\n\nThe classic-yarn Cypress docker harness (yarn 1.22.19) could not parse the\nBerry range-selective resolutions (\"form-data@^2.2.0\": \"2.5.6\" etc.) added by\nthe transitive-security-pin bump, mangling them into an invalid range and failing\ninstall before cypress could be installed (exit 127).\n\nRemove the three Berry descriptor-keyed resolutions (form-data@^2.2.0, form-data@^2.5.0,\ntar@^7.5.4); they were redundant — those ranges already resolve to the latest patched\nreleases (form-data 2.5.6 / 4.0.6, tar 7.x). Regenerate tests/yarn.lock in classic format.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"17fa665dfac7fe0c7d94b2eb7bf24aabdc63e9b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/17fa665dfac7fe0c7d94b2eb7bf24aabdc63e9b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/5c6b51879e88066db28710af3df1af7f2fea71d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 17fa665dfac7fe0c7d94b2eb7bf24aabdc63e9b8\nparent 69d2f415f7a2425f711d64f17c44b36a93665949\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782027022 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782027022 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a bruteForceLoginProtection namespace container (#42)\n\n* refactor: nest GraphQL operations under bruteForceLoginProtection namespace container\n\nMove the 8 root Query and 9 root Mutation flat fields (bruteForceLoginProtection*)\nunder a single hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention\n(one Query/Mutation field returning a <Module> type, operations nested inside).\n\n- Query:    bruteForceLoginProtectionGlobalSettings -> bruteForceLoginProtection { globalSettings }, etc.\n- Mutation: bruteForceLoginProtectionSaveJail       -> bruteForceLoginProtection { saveJail }, etc.\n\nNew holder types BruteForceLoginProtectionQuery/Mutation carry the operations as\ninstance @GraphQLField methods; the *Extension classes keep a single accessor field.\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf, so authorization is unchanged.\nFrontend gql.js + tabs and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep for the new schema.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* test: fix Cypress harness — replace Yarn-Berry-only resolutions with classic-compatible lockfile\n\nThe classic-yarn Cypress docker harness (yarn 1.22.19) could not parse the\nBerry range-selective resolutions (\"form-data@^2.2.0\": \"2.5.6\" etc.) added by\nthe transitive-security-pin bump, mangling them into an invalid range and failing\ninstall before cypress could be installed (exit 127).\n\nRemove the three Berry descriptor-keyed resolutions (form-data@^2.2.0, form-data@^2.5.0,\ntar@^7.5.4); they were redundant — those ranges already resolve to the latest patched\nreleases (form-data 2.5.6 / 4.0.6, tar 7.x). Regenerate tests/yarn.lock in classic format.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason"