{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/e91e31b3b595f7e50c364062d93fca60a1718c65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T11:19:25Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T11:19:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"build: target Java 17 and restore frontend-maven-plugin 2.0.0 (#25)\n\nbrute-force now builds and runs on Java 17 (compiler release 17, overriding the\nJava 11 baseline inherited from jahia-modules 8.2). Jahia 8.2 runs on Java 17, so\nthe module loads fine. This also lets the build use current tooling: frontend-maven-plugin\nis restored to 2.0.0 (it requires a Java 17 JVM), reversing the earlier 1.15.0 pin.\n\nNote: the typescript revert (6.0.3 -> 4.9.5) is unrelated to the JVM and stays — TS 6.0''s\ndownlevelIteration hard-deprecation is a Node-tooling issue, not a Java one.\n\nValidated with GraalVM 17: mvn clean install (Java 17 bytecode, major 61) + full Cypress\nsuite 16/16 against the Java 17 Jahia.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2b4d478c02dd18a88ee20afddea6a29d0032da9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/f2b4d478c02dd18a88ee20afddea6a29d0032da9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/e91e31b3b595f7e50c364062d93fca60a1718c65","verification":{"payload":"tree f2b4d478c02dd18a88ee20afddea6a29d0032da9\nparent ebf51b34b3b47d95a33e16fea3251f8215e4fdf5\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780917565 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780917565 +0200\n\nbuild: target Java 17 and restore frontend-maven-plugin 2.0.0 (#25)\n\nbrute-force now builds and runs on Java 17 (compiler release 17, overriding the\nJava 11 baseline inherited from jahia-modules 8.2). Jahia 8.2 runs on Java 17, so\nthe module loads fine. This also lets the build use current tooling: frontend-maven-plugin\nis restored to 2.0.0 (it requires a Java 17 JVM), reversing the earlier 1.15.0 pin.\n\nNote: the typescript revert (6.0.3 -> 4.9.5) is unrelated to the JVM and stays — TS 6.0''s\ndownlevelIteration hard-deprecation is a Node-tooling issue, not a Java one.\n\nValidated with GraalVM 17: mvn clean install (Java 17 bytecode, major 61) + full Cypress\nsuite 16/16 against the Java 17 Jahia.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJqU9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgboQAJnONCtBIIE4naOVwVQJCvRL\nft0ug/ec+QLmn2Eyp4KtR6f5BVyi7ZLLDuvqQ1LedMWoyRrKxE417zHllPxV6k9w\n5sqjW/BcIQoJLYU6OjyKsyPh1LpkqSxrnIwH8CH/V2FIBX6qHRMCqDmMZATpTWNU\n+6Qml9P0gvZmR2ElXMdFnNjwqmsDzHb+JQQsWyMJKOCyji4ZE3U1cE7M04XQYAVJ\nLYz5B8xL10rAOFBzB8niChcSAcOzhNWMuUc4w/RG72XmHAiRpKFyVZTTfhVDJT9N\nYAkvJzgu+S4xtCR7z7FiC6xCksS/1Xv6P6cxcJzVoKskSexn7BfezTWcBC0K/vHP\nh/cQqg95aeS2wjgyc22jasCydyZ0WkmeNTsezgVcq8171oc1jSWoV4E/DpgMKkVc\nQLStLP/1vEOBwQK78pb7BJhv1Y000sZxy4OYLFgIyt5z96Eai+Wm552KF4wjaiQ3\nVjgj64+4wcQnajjMDMHLi/lOCjIInCyhyER0c3u9RGvfxIYpTwVObjKeDSkL1/42\nwT0+hFlLuPtM5SZ4na5xtDzoB4vcE5huUWVAsw/zB435hoU3HpPLub87u0L3mLtV