e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/ebf51b34b3b47d95a33e16fea3251f8215e4fdf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T18:32:54Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T18:32:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: restore Java-11 build and Cypress compilation broken by Dependabot bumps (#24)\n\nTwo merged Dependabot bumps broke brute-force on the project''s Java 11 baseline:\n\n1. frontend-maven-plugin 1.15.0 -> 2.0.0 requires Java 17 (class file 61.0), so\n   ''mvn clean install'' failed at install-node-and-yarn with UnsupportedClassVersionError.\n   Reverted to 1.15.0 (last Java-8/11-compatible line; AGENTS.md documents the build\n   as Java 11).\n2. typescript 4.9.5 -> 6.0.3 turns the ''downlevelIteration'' option (injected by the\n   Cypress webpack preprocessor) into a hard TS5101 error, so Cypress could not compile\n   the spec. Reverted to 4.9.5 (the version the suite already compiled against).\n\nValidated end-to-end: mvn clean install (Java 11) succeeds and the full Cypress suite\npasses 16/16.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb48890e6cb39559f1343d51bcd6bcecd150e54e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/cb48890e6cb39559f1343d51bcd6bcecd150e54e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/ebf51b34b3b47d95a33e16fea3251f8215e4fdf5","verification":{"payload":"tree cb48890e6cb39559f1343d51bcd6bcecd150e54e\nparent f6c6b55a54eab5a22f5559434e7fad8b84da5487\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780857174 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780857174 +0200\n\nfix: restore Java-11 build and Cypress compilation broken by Dependabot bumps (#24)\n\nTwo merged Dependabot bumps broke brute-force on the project''s Java 11 baseline:\n\n1. frontend-maven-plugin 1.15.0 -> 2.0.0 requires Java 17 (class file 61.0), so\n   ''mvn clean install'' failed at install-node-and-yarn with UnsupportedClassVersionError.\n   Reverted to 1.15.0 (last Java-8/11-compatible line; AGENTS.md documents the build\n   as Java 11).\n2. typescript 4.9.5 -> 6.0.3 turns the ''downlevelIteration'' option (injected by the\n   Cypress webpack preprocessor) into a hard TS5101 error, so Cypress could not compile\n   the spec. Reverted to 4.9.5 (the version the suite already compiled against).\n\nValidated end-to-end: mvn clean install (Java 11) succeeds and the full Cypress suite\npasses 16/16.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJblWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA30QABHu+y9Pkb1tZTRthz/s9EcN\na42AIaXOAw+eXC1wvXTcQloDEjLZfIeXIzvcSzuj8lFRiQ1mQljv/ActP29nrYz+\nZHSsNHkx4uBUov+Lb2oknNhfRD3O2x/IrFJp7PUINWYmcWsG49q86agLHowcCsTv\n1kCiEOL8ZymBgPkyURY7u8YUp7DRQXpusijPT0VvcnocUziSqaDdaAGBh43/amCP\nBaoRCYQnPPsQllf6q5KjB+sc9Ct8CSu7XMCK88GsH6xCx3lAG+QOY7AN7e+NpLOi\nt+BMrU9UZAMH26Q8XbnLXxJQu6PphzjgpatLhr1g415S8czxks8Gtev+Pk7tiT8s\n97wsXSEr9PJFyp9IAGvylRC9dHdjmrZtMgSHiniiSxRMCg1JhoktUS57H9eKLPNK\nlz0SPxF8HvyVdjAPLAvTzS6T7CTj2/eSJ2Rp6wOM5MQUBjRk4tUmqOI2/rqKJHnz\nUPfXrv