api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/2e797b460cf585af645919f9bd474af7997f6b51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:48:12Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:48:12Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: shutdown IGNORE_PATTERN_EXECUTOR on BruteForceTracker bundle deactivate\n\nThe static ThreadPoolExecutor for regex matching was never shut down when\nthe OSGi bundle is stopped, leaking worker threads. Added @Deactivate\ndeactivate() that calls shutdownNow() on the executor pool.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7df86ca9df1ab3141d3a903ae526a14f0f80eef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/7df86ca9df1ab3141d3a903ae526a14f0f80eef1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/2e797b460cf585af645919f9bd474af7997f6b51","verification":{"payload":"tree 7df86ca9df1ab3141d3a903ae526a14f0f80eef1\nparent f46fe352c999a3c95b9abb5288370a80a723a9de\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750092 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750092 +0200\n\nfix: shutdown IGNORE_PATTERN_EXECUTOR on BruteForceTracker bundle deactivate\n\nThe static ThreadPoolExecutor for regex matching was never shut down when\nthe OSGi bundle is stopped, leaking worker threads. Added @Deactivate\ndeactivate() that calls shutdownNow() on the executor pool.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFwwACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lhWwf/X8VneA/6oWfZot6jlv/2Fq70vZZTSxpxryZ7akXvYzZv/SjSG77aJKeR\nu+ElwqEgX9FhhOX2alal5LbR+vJjgLceD57wqD29uedDgUixZOWKjPdN/7pl6okP\nIMlHAbGH+xocayq3sMYBMNjy8kzlAqavf9o45K8ji7dRKippuj++9ztDpyNP2vf2\n+zv6TI28QAjcLkma/ethu2CZXS03OtH5HwJdBL6ro3FawAf/V9sD9EvyZHuPuYsU\nq+9v