m/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/f46fe352c999a3c95b9abb5288370a80a723a9de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:48:05Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:48:05Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"perf: move AuditLogger trimIfNeeded off the per-write hot path\n\nThe O(n) JCR scan + sort in trimIfNeeded was called on every audit entry\nwrite (i.e. on every login failure). Decoupled by:\n- Adding a public trimAuditLog() method called by UnbanScheduler.sweep()\n  every 30 s (the existing scheduler thread).\n- Keeping a piggyback trim every 50 writes inside log() as a safety net\n  so the log stays bounded even under high load between periodic sweeps.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"622b551c31d6c6320e4f8971d0491c3eff503b78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/622b551c31d6c6320e4f8971d0491c3eff503b78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/f46fe352c999a3c95b9abb5288370a80a723a9de","verification":{"payload":"tree 622b551c31d6c6320e4f8971d0491c3eff503b78\nparent 4e6ffa94fcdba79f379e79d5042605130e6c6a4a\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750085 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750085 +0200\n\nperf: move AuditLogger trimIfNeeded off the per-write hot path\n\nThe O(n) JCR scan + sort in trimIfNeeded was called on every audit entry\nwrite (i.e. on every login failure). Decoupled by:\n- Adding a public trimAuditLog() method called by UnbanScheduler.sweep()\n  every 30 s (the existing scheduler thread).\n- Keeping a piggyback trim every 50 writes inside log() as a safety net\n  so the log stays bounded even under high load between periodic sweeps.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFwUACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3l4Qgf/aa2PycAt1Jh5rMukxzpKZ5POjExNKfSaPbouTE+53mLGfzcelnZ1HeCz\nHncQd7LwRoPNsEdnUeB8qGaPUm+vfSrxsRFbL0nbBIlNwpjF4p6grovlVGYP8Dpo\nfS+w86XnbADFYrNJCCMBZ+KM/8e8g95KCQJK/095knKO3FaTRikXYTaHz8Lm8E1H\nL2D66a/LIOFGNf26uXDI2cRrfe9DXP6BV3wId2gfSzXsPA8Ama1HSSKaJ/L3eerd\n0d07RtNoAwPv5hOciW+qWlvDYIn0iQrPDeyXq16IrMFqI3sVttyOHnpaXYCkkZw5\n8gC9CJC12Yn+pYcj7zi9/d4A18Zjcg==\n=YaVI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:37:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/f46fe352c999a3c95b9abb5288370a80a723a9de","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKGY0NmZlMzUyYzk5OWEzYzk1YjlhYmI1Mjg4MzcwYTgwYTcyM2E5ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/4e6ffa94fcdba79f379e79d5042605130e6c6a4a","sha":"4e6ffa94fcdba79f379e79d5042605130e6c6a4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/4e6ffa94fcdba79f379e79d5042605130e6c6a4a"}],"sha":"f46fe352c999a3c95b9abb5288370a80a723a9de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/f46fe352c999a3c95b9abb5288370a80a723a9de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/4e6ffa94fcdba79f379e79d5042605130e6c6a4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: throw on webhookSecret encryption failure instead of persisting plaintext\n\nReplace the silent plaintext fallback in WebhookSecretCodec.encrypt with an\nIllegalStateException so a failed EncryptionUtils call never causes the\nplaintext secret to be written to the .cfg file. Update SettingsService to\nlet the exception propagate for intentional saves while catching it in the\nopportunistic re-encrypt path (best-effort, not a user-facing operation).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"5fb93985bbbc0d341b1801a830ae7f86ab7433eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/5fb93985bbbc0d341b1801a830ae7f86ab7433eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/4e6ffa94fcdba79f379e79d5042605130e6c6a4a","verification":{"payload":"tree 5fb93985bbbc0d341b1801a830ae7f86ab7433eb\nparent f3a6d4b6c97e1ffaa12f6861b4284640f41638bd\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750077 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750077 +0200\n\nfix: throw on webhookSecret encryption failure instead of persisting plaintext\n\nReplace the silent plaintext fallback in WebhookSecretCodec.encrypt with an\nIllegalStateException so a failed EncryptionUtils call never causes the\nplaintext secret to be written to the .cfg file. Update SettingsService to\nlet the exception propagate for intentional saves while catching it in the\nopportunistic re-encrypt path (best-effort, not a user-facing operation).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFv0ACgkQUhsG