 11.1.1\n\nTest-only dependency tree; production bundle unaffected.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a771de8a22b509697b9f6125b9b1fc89c275bb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/9a771de8a22b509697b9f6125b9b1fc89c275bb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/f3cc3d7064919dc9678d4afedf1cea1d1d8b777f","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a771de8a22b509697b9f6125b9b1fc89c275bb9\nparent e2f37b420834e1d697d3cdfab11081c857aa2b9c\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779545133 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779545133 +0200\n\nPin qs >=6.15.2 and uuid >=11.1.1 in tests/ resolutions\n\nResolves Dependabot alerts for transitive Cypress deps:\n- qs 6.14.2 (DoS via qs.stringify with null/undefined entries) -> 6.15.2\n- uuid 8.3.2 (missing buffer bounds check in v3/v5/v6) -> 11.1.1\n\nTest-only dependency tree; production bundle unaffected.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoRtC0ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kAGAf9FzG5GZTmMdHRceFTX/H8bRLLVNx95MJgimwHjpCilaKglftmjaEqGafq\nVYnJn1j4kVMKIN8rOBCu5vJKIC5n8JwgQom9oP1IcQPZDY/gyjLADFE6p/aK4zYY\nTzyMLjoz2BID3QBVSxUlX0IM0IdpfBZEtXff/jyOEkBg+WF9HjEOH0OLAtxvPtQZ\nrBUd/GrQaJ999ZXGA1W3tdkdXfLlX6v9p+WujGir2ct/aQfKCIl7AcDQ7teeMG2c\n7gygcBMd79cwGbg0h3a+o+UYZ1nmtDzi4gvlKMBlmszF18tEpgUUtHitHmcX+olA\n8vGMXfClXHg3/l9NqKGkcPk329T2wA==\n=j4ZM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T14:07:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gi