uilt-in detector order table\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0a85a553ba241721c20aa89ffc52c442eb09576","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/a0a85a553ba241721c20aa89ffc52c442eb09576"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/f6f08ed1657935edcc72d1e2bc1695c9087d5a9f","verification":{"payload":"tree a0a85a553ba241721c20aa89ffc52c442eb09576\nparent 02d6044c64de939fc69ea65389db325320bda8fb\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779544865 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779544865 +0200\n\nDocument AuthFailureDetector SPI in README and add 3.0.0 release notes\n\n- Mention auth-detector SPI and the new auth-scheme coverage in the\n  Features section\n- Add an Extending section with a worked example showing how to register\n  a custom AuthFailureDetector\n- Add RELEASE_NOTES_3.0.0.md summarising the 3.0.0 highlights, breaking\n  changes and the built-in detector order table\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoRsyEACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nFHwf+KdcY997cOkE0WVP2765+fcZcT9LUwdwyax1mx2JrS6rJrBwCzuvYTT6D\nup3kFO5aLYqcQkZJiYmcQVqVUhaVl8o5GV6WuEv9ctTE4EjJ7oHCbsEFjSDYxH+3\nKwDhVnGxFkv1fs4fPNiJPldQJVyAoNw6oGmLmJyxRfgh1PYEGVYTf7rlu1hQTEwM\nCNebjdZchLMLxPSDszUhik5PmST4treQUjjiQCizXgom06uHmDfommT3O0XkoNTh\nsWcWcYu2z0KLX9GFJfL16bv88bKFt0T+4KZCl7punXg5b3a9rcYwW2EYyVMkbGOV\na3d+7G4oorNCUoPNY9rLeKZxdMHB8Q==\n=ToDT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T14:01:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https