os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/02d6044c64de939fc69ea65389db325320bda8fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T13:58:21Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T13:58:21Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Reuse HEADER constant for jahiatoken authScheme tag\n\nSonar S1192 flagged ''jahiatoken'' as a duplicated literal in the\nJahiaTokenAuthFailureDetector. The header name and the audit-tag\nvalue are the same string, so reuse the existing HEADER constant\nrather than introducing a second one.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"91ca6dcd90dda1f046dc77986c826610991ad006","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/91ca6dcd90dda1f046dc77986c826610991ad006"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/02d6044c64de939fc69ea65389db325320bda8fb","verification":{"payload":"tree 91ca6dcd90dda1f046dc77986c826610991ad006\nparent 47f0bc970a99cf4fe2884eba24e3e212ab49fad1\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779544701 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779544701 +0200\n\nReuse HEADER constant for jahiatoken authScheme tag\n\nSonar S1192 flagged ''jahiatoken'' as a duplicated literal in the\nJahiaTokenAuthFailureDetector. The header name and the audit-tag\nvalue are the same string, so reuse the existing HEADER constant\nrather than introducing a second one.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9Uh