ps://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/02d6044c64de939fc69ea65389db325320bda8fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/47f0bc970a99cf4fe2884eba24e3e212ab49fad1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T09:41:45Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T09:41:45Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Introduce AuthFailureDetector SPI for pluggable auth-scheme coverage\n\nRefactor AuthValveFailureSource to delegate post-invokeNext failure\ndetection to a list of AuthFailureDetector services bound via OSGi\n@Reference(MULTIPLE,DYNAMIC). Each detector inspects an\nAuthFailureContext (request + post-chain authenticated flag) and returns\na FailureSignal when the scheme it understands has failed. The valve\nrecords the first matching signal — real requests only carry one auth\nscheme, so iterating all would risk double-counting.\n\nShip four built-in detectors covering every credential-bearing Jahia\ncore valve plus the personal-api-tokens module:\n\n  - FormLoginFailureDetector (100) — VALVE_RESULT branch, covers\n    LoginEngineAuthValveImpl and every SsoValve subclass\n  - BasicAuthFailureDetector (200) — Authorization: Basic\n  - ApiTokenAuthFailureDetector (300) — Authorization: APIToken\n  - JahiaTokenAuthFailureDetector (400) — deprecated jahiatoken header\n\nSession / cookie / container-principal valves are intentionally not\ncovered: they restore prior auth state rather than verify credentials,\nso a missing/invalid cookie is not a brute-force signal.\n\nThird parties extend coverage by registering their own @Component\nimplementing AuthFailureDetector — no patches to BFLP required.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"d640b3c6899b7b5fba5981f5abcd9e307075812f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/d640b3c6899b7b5fba5981f5abcd9e307075812f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/47f0bc970a99cf4fe2884eba24e3e212ab49fad1","verification":{"payload":"tree d640b3c6899b7b5fba5981f5abcd9e307075812f\nparent baadd22aadf936e51c8764034697e8de202aa00a\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779529305 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779529305 +0200\n\nIntroduce AuthFailureDetector SPI for pluggable auth-scheme coverage\n\nRefactor AuthValveFailureSource to delegate post-invokeNext failure\ndetection to a list of AuthFailureDetector services bound via OSGi\n@Reference(MULTIPLE,DYNAMIC). Each detector inspects an\nAuthFailureContext (request + post-chain authenticated flag) and returns\na FailureSignal when the scheme it understands has failed. The valve\nrecords the first matching signal — real requests only carry one auth\nscheme, so iterating all would risk double-counting.\n\nShip four built-in detectors covering every credential-bearing Jahia\ncore valve plus the personal-api-tokens module:\n\n  - FormLoginFailureDetector (100) — VALVE_RESULT branch, covers\n    LoginEngineAuthValveImpl and every SsoValve subclass\n  - BasicAuthFailureDetector (200) — Authorization: Basic\n  - ApiTokenAuthFailureDetector (300) — Authorization: APIToken\n  - JahiaTokenAuthFailureDetector (400) — deprecated jahiatoken header\n\nSession / cookie / container-principal valves are intentionally not\ncovered: they restore prior auth state rather than verify credentials,\nso a missing/invalid cookie is not a brute-force signal.\n\nThird parties extend coverage by registering their own @Component\nimplementing AuthFailureDetector — no patches to BFLP required.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoRdlkACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3niBAf9EZy+Zt20Mw0ix1xvvbyRgNbnRdn7vcU0dsd5UnBGMG+yeuya6MEgYEau\nv0mD2Mi2c5FmX+Cn94G7ooBBTYo1ITogyxcAzoX/fLvjZk1IJaeQow0YMu0yg9Se\nT+JlnEYiy25fOui9ARPUL7VY2RlnqJekPgBBAHtEcA/M6AMRBqWHcfvV1HhSzJYZ\nn6DALqTFW8CnbkzpUzMz/0SwHdZV2vqBK5OJrk9fcqnEPmT2FZHWJSSLfiH1UMXQ\n8y5i4s1YKiSERu6+pf/99Wm+05Np6SRtEbVONw998KZe8aOuqwfa8J9pOGCZsaX9\n88mGfl8o35KbuivZtaVqZY7udQbtaQ==\n=XXke\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T09:54:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/47f0bc970a99cf4fe2884eba24e3e212ab49fad1","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKDQ3ZjBiYzk3MGE5OWNmNGZlMjg4NGViYTI0ZTNlMjEyYWI0OWZhZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/baadd22aadf936e51c8764034697e8de202aa00a","sha":"baadd22aadf936e51c8764034697e8de202aa00a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/baadd22aadf936e51c8764034697e8de202aa00a"}],"sha":"47f0bc970a99cf4fe2884eba24e3e212ab49fad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/47f0bc970a99cf4fe2884eba24e3e212ab49fad1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/baadd22aadf936e51c8764034697e8de202aa00a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:38:04Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:38:04Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Track Personal API token failures in AuthValveFailureSource\n\nTokenAuthValve (personal-api-tokens module) silently leaves the request\nunauthenticated on an invalid APIToken header without setting VALVE_RESULT\nor firing a login event — same blind spot as HttpBasicAuthValveImpl.\n\nDetect `Authorization: APIToken …` headers pre-invokeNext, and if the auth\npipeline leaves currentUser null/guest, record a failure with\nsourceName=\"api-token-valve\". The token string is intentionally not stored\nas a username since it is a bearer secret.\n\nCypress regression POSTs an invalid token to /modules/graphql twice to\ntrigger the ban, then asserts the audit log contains a BAN event and at\nleast one entry sourced from api-token-valve.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"a07955494258c441e8b0e082e5219a4cbe126cb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/a07955494258c441e8b0e082e5219a4cbe126cb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/baadd22aadf936e51c8764034697e8de202aa00a","verification":{"payload":"tree a07955494258c441e8b0e082e5219a4cbe126cb9\nparent 195f8f65d40a64e9034424a3384fb74525cea414\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779464284 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779464284 +0200\n\nTrack Personal API token failures in AuthValveFailureSource\n\nTokenAuthValve (personal-api-tokens module) silently leaves the request\nunauthenticated on an invalid APIToken header without setting VALVE_RESULT\nor firing a login event — same blind spot as HttpBasicAuthValveImpl.\n\nDetect `Authorization: APIToken …` headers pre-invokeNext, and if the auth\npipeline leaves currentUser null/guest, record a failure with\nsourceName=\"api-token-valve\". The token string is intentionally not stored\nas a username since it is a bearer secret.\n\nCypress regression POSTs an invalid token to /modules/graphql twice to\ntrigger the ban, then asserts the audit log contains a BAN event and at\nleast one entry sourced from api-token-valve.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQeFwACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3k8ZAf/YOijM8k4Uk6CslDLaE6ufB4Gt2YJmWkpAF88RQ/JJBd9vARlCDF0Zw4S\ngmxMb150Mj/YQfrGVVokfm6J40xWeJI5OHjdFH3alYzWL6qgv6XMQdAUdUHXais7\nbyK+Qh+/gnTE6xB/KOrKIV1vFsxHL+ngkCx+qgT0juyNg5DzDdNwqrC6PSLeKo0b\nqZBsJkEhEk/OjP+ZTAXM/uXutI3aC/hMdAWsJRcNmWLuQNahgcAZkyxQNiCIahGT\nopRbHKNG5NOvOFzgO9dQ5su8VxWmUbgM5MIbKyHr1K1wblyOgCw57CrcrCxbOI4g\na+M4LsB4e4tdgsmAcIR+DIgzxKHyTA==\n=8Ngg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T09:33:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/baadd22aadf936e51c8764034697e8de202aa00a","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKGJhYWRkMjJhYWRmOTM2ZTUxYzg3NjQwMzQ2OTdlOGRlMjAyYWEwMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/195f8f65d40a64e9034424a3384fb74525cea414","sha":"195f8f65d40a64e9034424a3384fb74525cea414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/195f8f65d40a64e9034424a3384fb74525cea414"}],"sha":"baadd22aadf936e51c8764034697e8de202aa00a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/baadd22aadf936e51c8764034697e8de202aa00a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/195f8f65d40a64e9034424a3384fb74525cea414/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:30:01Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:30:01Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Let Basic-auth ban expire before reading the audit log\n\nThe cy.login() that fetches the audit log was running from the same IP\nthat had just been jailed, so it returned 401 and the audit assertions\nnever ran. Clear cookies and wait out the 15s ban window before\nre-authenticating; the post-test wait is kept as a safety net for the\nnext spec.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"178d1961462998baa402dbbfda10ad8803e156a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/178d1961462998baa402dbbfda10ad8803e156a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/195f8f65d40a64e9034424a3384fb74525cea414","verification":{"payload":"tree 178d1961462998baa402dbbfda10ad8803e156a9\nparent ea92404bc5284cb8fa2c5696598c19b9d8774a3b\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779463801 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779463801 +0200\n\nLet Basic-auth ban expire before reading the audit log\n\nThe cy.login() that fetches the audit log was running from the same IP\nthat had just been jailed, so it returned 401 and the audit assertions\nnever ran. Clear cookies and wait out the 15s ban window before\nre-authenticating; the post-test wait is kept as a safety net for the\nnext spec.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQdnkACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nVewf/Q24bw43D+dw4OLlw8g8E3T2SAz4j/8Cb0Rxv0CmGaVq3bhi+kS/g+/Ug\nqe3mdXNiWFWug3GLQK7MnjGti0VOSZg24kgLiCbQ9xniB+iINEVJOOoTVWJfNCtK\nb6t+gx4GkRmi9LVlUh2vGmaKryvdMvW3Zl46XlT+lsRjt22Wl6NPVh20H8RzMpDN\nbgq2E8sW8E+Fsbixag0HLA35+hw20hgCoUFcV28QzbVjPiT+b/U8OB0SzYKBt3pq\n9SqIFMrMkIwl/7Tg4n9CPiK7e7EsSKkUo10FDE/o0UlahrGnOwrKPRB1EfFjGkDJ\nJRgwiNEwG566u1ye2a3bXZiVQLzhLg==\n=ADcw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T09:33:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/195f8f65d40a64e9034424a3384fb74525cea414","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKDE5NWY4ZjY1ZDQwYTY0ZTkwMzQ0MjRhMzM4NGZiNzQ1MjVjZWE0MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/ea92404bc5284cb8fa2c5696598c19b9d8774a3b","sha":"ea92404bc5284cb8fa2c5696598c19b9d8774a3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/ea92404bc5284cb8fa2c5696598c19b9d8774a3b"}],"sha":"195f8f65d40a64e9034424a3384fb74525cea414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/195f8f65d40a64e9034424a3384fb74525cea414"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/ea92404bc5284cb8fa2c5696598c19b9d8774a3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:14:22Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:14:22Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Add Cypress test for Basic auth brute-force ban\n\nMirrors the existing form-login brute-force scenario but exercises the\nHTTP Basic auth path so we can regress the AuthValveFailureSource hook\nthat closes the BFLP coverage gap on /modules/* endpoints. The test:\n\n  1. Tightens the \"login\" jail to maxRetry=2, banTime=15s and waits for\n     the OSGi config holders to converge.\n  2. Sends two GETs with bad Basic credentials against the admin path.\n  3. Verifies that a follow-up GET with VALID credentials still gets\n     401 — the IP is now in the ban map.\n  4. Asserts the audit log contains at least one BAN event and at least\n     one entry with source=\"basic-auth-valve\", proving the new\n     detection branch fired rather than the existing form-login one.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d411e8f44e670d17819424ad020e9d058b52211","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/1d411e8f44e670d17819424ad020e9d058b52211"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/ea92404bc5284cb8fa2c5696598c19b9d8774a3b","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d411e8f44e670d17819424ad020e9d058b52211\nparent 42f3fbc4fb4a6b925ff8ab26adc018447dd27eda\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779462862 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779462862 +0200\n\nAdd Cypress test for Basic auth brute-force ban\n\nMirrors the existing form-login brute-force scenario but exercises the\nHTTP Basic auth path so we can regress the AuthValveFailureSource hook\nthat closes the BFLP coverage gap on /modules/* endpoints. The test:\n\n  1. Tightens the \"login\" jail to maxRetry=2, banTime=15s and waits for\n     the OSGi config holders to converge.\n  2. Sends two GETs with bad Basic credentials against the admin path.\n  3. Verifies that a follow-up GET with VALID credentials still gets\n     401 — the IP is now in the ban map.\n  4. Asserts the audit log contains at least one BAN event and at least\n     one entry with source=\"basic-auth-valve\", proving the new\n     detection branch fired rather than the existing form-login one.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQcs4ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kDCAgArqQHZWq+tkEMbNcZ2yYQwlTrQuv+1NKNe6mKwdWVqKDzhsapAgsONLFR\nC6Z+/xGXtNoZCtnmz7WI8BsRj0shajpiWpby2WFZz0nXxxlYgGe2YkW0M3ne23YB\nCJxJvVhIiGrbdu8Ko+8yQ86OxNPLDDgsNfzOqAlSbxVr/6Ozdd8jMkwxtuzg+iQz\n7eGfMfWyrSAutC+4P6ZcqPEphz+H3MzDpjgf6nlOaJS79f9OsYee59CeWT6GDLYq\nWSzuBDtr8uwxTSUxbNXwxqxcZIkJ3uWzOC3/VAAbPTIUKI1XicmYjpLOUNM9s+ry\n0kAiWepgt8ca477w76h2v27essuOvg==\n=4rJS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T09:33:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/ea92404bc5284cb8fa2c5696598c19b9d8774a3b","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKGVhOTI0MDRiYzUyODRjYjhmYTJjNTY5NjU5OGMxOWI5ZDg3NzRhM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/42f3fbc4fb4a6b925ff8ab26adc018447dd27eda","sha":"42f3fbc4fb4a6b925ff8ab26adc018447dd27eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/42f3fbc4fb4a6b925ff8ab26adc018447dd27eda"}],"sha":"ea92404bc5284cb8fa2c5696598c19b9d8774a3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/ea92404bc5284cb8fa2c5696598c19b9d8774a3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/42f3fbc4fb4a6b925ff8ab26adc018447dd27eda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T14:56:18Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T14:56:18Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Track HTTP Basic auth failures in AuthValveFailureSource\n\nHttpBasicAuthValveImpl sets triggerLoginEventEnabled(false) and never\npopulates LoginEngineAuthValveImpl.VALVE_RESULT, so failed Basic auth\nattempts were invisible to BFLP — an attacker brute-forcing\n/modules/healthcheck (or any other endpoint reachable via Basic auth)\nwould never accumulate failure counts and never be jailed.\n\nAfter invokeNext() unwinds, the auth pipeline''s outcome can be observed\non the JCRSessionFactory: success installs a non-guest JahiaUser,\nfailure leaves currentUser null or guest. When the request carried an\n\"Authorization: Basic ...\" header and post-chain state is unauthenticated,\nrecord a FailureEvent with sourceName=\"basic-auth-valve\" against the\nexisting login jail. Form-login and Basic auth are mutually exclusive on\na single request, so this cannot double-count.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2c0a353464a88d75806b22971171c7203a49808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/a2c0a353464a88d75806b22971171c7203a49808"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/42f3fbc4fb4a6b925ff8ab26adc018447dd27eda","verification":{"payload":"tree a2c0a353464a88d75806b22971171c7203a49808\nparent a669c75aa69a5b609c669b9b17e4d60e893d4446\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779461778 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779461778 +0200\n\nTrack HTTP Basic auth failures in AuthValveFailureSource\n\nHttpBasicAuthValveImpl sets triggerLoginEventEnabled(false) and never\npopulates LoginEngineAuthValveImpl.VALVE_RESULT, so failed Basic auth\nattempts were invisible to BFLP — an attacker brute-forcing\n/modules/healthcheck (or any other endpoint reachable via Basic auth)\nwould never accumulate failure counts and never be jailed.\n\nAfter invokeNext() unwinds, the auth pipeline''s outcome can be observed\non the JCRSessionFactory: success installs a non-guest JahiaUser,\nfailure leaves currentUser null or guest. When the request carried an\n\"Authorization: Basic ...\" header and post-chain state is unauthenticated,\nrecord a FailureEvent with sourceName=\"basic-auth-valve\" against the\nexisting login jail. Form-login and Basic auth are mutually exclusive on\na single request, so this cannot double-count.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQbpIACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kR+Qf/X9OuEkET+WhW7B85trnW3mVm2IAcLt/0jur8oaOXfJFCnpDUGWM3Okvb\nWesdKP2YpIPhaxim9EHJckj3jqLv1KwdmyT2uZDjrgT8/xb5/d/7UxADGsUDwOKy\nk1IhZi4IKEmtpNZVEH6Cq6j5uPrVsm9p8I5Hj9hiF/9697A04uEUGwQGPu+wCaRR\nKLV4LSHRS7C2nBFt/AvdG9c/TYjwWiZa2MRt6ZJFr+N2sUWi5nfTEDHLbIU6Q830\nF+me9q0+msS7lZLSGuB4BYQhkKWZKbsEXALtLJBYnqlQRwHa4T4xn++wO193cPGE\n5cKJk1akMv43f7E3dpxWZg/RAMIi6Q==\n=2sjo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T09:33:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gis