/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/a669c75aa69a5b609c669b9b17e4d60e893d4446/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T14:31:04Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T14:31:04Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(bflp): cast operand to long in audit trim subtraction (sonar S2184)\n\nPromote nodes.size() to long before the subtraction so the arithmetic\nhappens in 64-bit, satisfying SonarQube S2184 (implicit narrow cast of\nsubtraction result).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd91aa7f0eea6429b24fe58c2290438e1e0abe78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/cd91aa7f0eea6429b24fe58c2290438e1e0abe78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/a669c75aa69a5b609c669b9b17e4d60e893d4446","verification":{"payload":"tree cd91aa7f0eea6429b24fe58c2290438e1e0abe78\nparent 1fbfc3525c883efe0e98e965c793654d0a7d8dd0\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779460264 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779460264 +0200\n\nfix(bflp): cast operand to long in audit trim subtraction (sonar S2184)\n\nPromote nodes.size() to long before the subtraction so the arithmetic\nhappens in 64-bit, satisfying SonarQube S2184 (implicit narrow cast of\nsubtraction result).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQaKgACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kR+wf9GMQFjvCHZoGLrtwoYvCIEiMe9MSK2BPjkBmdC0Fn9ncEeXAanaRK