b17e4d60e893d4446"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/1fbfc3525c883efe0e98e965c793654d0a7d8dd0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T14:22:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T14:22:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(bflp): darken cluster-status text to meet WCAG 2 AAA contrast\n\naxe-core flagged the healthy variant at AA-boundary contrast (~7:1) when\nAAA requires >=7:1 for normal text. Darken both healthy and degraded\nforegrounds (#0d3d12, #5c2d00) while keeping the green/orange background\ntint as the semantic signal.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3631cec34fea9047deb305b91695644a1e3be9cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/3631cec34fea9047deb305b91695644a1e3be9cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/1fbfc3525c883efe0e98e965c793654d0a7d8dd0","verification":{"payload":"tree 3631cec34fea9047deb305b91695644a1e3be9cb\nparent 496cd44b842035592b2a52a1d7289510c0f4ad37\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779459777 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779459777 +0200\n\nfix(bflp): darken cluster-status text to meet WCAG 2 AAA contrast\n\naxe-core flagged the healthy variant at AA-boundary contrast (~7:1) when\nAAA requires >=7:1 for normal text. Darken both healthy and degraded\nforegrounds (#0d3d12, #5c2d00) while keeping the green/orange background\ntint as the semantic signal.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQZsEACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nlqgf+LB6A35N3ewWbmoersm+ipMgj9I6RFbp3b4bqix/BvJSGOkqwWV666DTA\n9iXD0MYCyfWRAfKM7VIsAVlfmvWoQOPoAXfoYJMI40uqQPMSjllO33jFAanfHycn\nEoMBlbCLuZDvb9WhLo+ih/L2etfyJek2bnPTtSoVPDT40B1dgdQ/X8mFUAvLxx4K\nBSxD0TViMbyKyWeTPwrdDCZQhLaF2ir0Yhlf9WaWjZDmwDJNYO+NjNqkQJ22erhB\nn+onqh+OQgXrx766HCBL57Kcwa7pqok9H5rqUs9wbh50NVyo7GreVc+A6tkxkV4N\n2N/gbBAfPhtQ5L5h/OhEN+apnTfg7g==\n=PLvR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T14:36:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/1fbfc3525c883efe0e98e965c793654d0a7d8dd0","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKDFmYmZjMzUyNWM4ODNlZmUwZTk4ZTk2NWM3OTM2NTRkMGE3ZDhkZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/496cd44b842035592b2a52a1d7289510c0f4ad37","sha":"496cd44b842035592b2a52a1d7289510c0f4ad37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/496cd44b842035592b2a52a1d7289510c0f4ad37"}],"sha":"1fbfc3525c883efe0e98e965c793654d0a7d8dd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/1fbfc3525c883efe0e98e965c793654d0a7d8dd0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/496cd44b842035592b2a52a1d7289510c0f4ad37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T14:05:00Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T14:05:00Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(bflp): use audit-log container type for yyyy/MM/dd bucket folders\n\nBuckets were created as jnt:contentFolder, but jnt:contentFolder''s child\nnode definition only accepts hierarchy nodes (nt:hierarchyNode and subtypes).\njnt:bruteForceLoginProtectionAuditEntry extends jnt:content, which extends\nnt:base — not nt:hierarchyNode — so Jackrabbit rejected the addNode with\n\\\"No child node definition for e-... found in node .../yyyy/MM/dd\\\".\n\nThe auditLog container itself works only because of the explicit\n\\\"+ * (AuditEntry)\\\" wildcard on the jnt:bruteForceLoginProtectionAuditLog\ntype. Re-using that same type for buckets makes the wildcard apply at every\nnested level, so AuditEntry children are accepted recursively.\n\nAlso self-heal previously broken bucket folders: when an existing yyyy/MM/dd\nfolder is still of the old jnt:contentFolder type, remove and recreate it\n(those folders are empty because entries never wrote into them, so this is\nnon-destructive). Align j:splitNodeType in the CND so Jahia''s autosplit path,\nif ever invoked, would create the same bucket type our writer does.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2fbd59f320c9f315f1affcddb9358a5a62fecba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/e2fbd59f320c9f315f1affcddb9358a5a62fecba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/496cd44b842035592b2a52a1d7289510c0f4ad37","verification":{"payload":"tree e2fbd59f320c9f315f1affcddb9358a5a62fecba\nparent 9b4606d99d50fe5acab325234a341f77d6a4c847\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779458700 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779458700 +0200\n\nfix(bflp): use audit-log container type for yyyy/MM/dd bucket folders\n\nBuckets were created as jnt:contentFolder, but jnt:contentFolder''s child\nnode definition only accepts hierarchy nodes (nt:hierarchyNode and subtypes).\njnt:bruteForceLoginProtectionAuditEntry extends jnt:content, which extends\nnt:base — not nt:hierarchyNode — so Jackrabbit rejected the addNode with\n\\\"No child node definition for e-... found in node .../yyyy/MM/dd\\\".\n\nThe auditLog container itself works only because of the explicit\n\\\"+ * (AuditEntry)\\\" wildcard on the jnt:bruteForceLoginProtectionAuditLog\ntype. Re-using that same type for buckets makes the wildcard apply at every\nnested level, so AuditEntry children are accepted recursively.\n\nAlso self-heal previously broken bucket folders: when an existing yyyy/MM/dd\nfolder is still of the old jnt:contentFolder type, remove and recreate it\n(those folders are empty because entries never wrote into them, so this is\nnon-destructive). Align j:splitNodeType in the CND so Jahia''s autosplit path,\nif ever invoked, would create the same bucket type our writer does.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQYowACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nGPgf/fsTzQ8Hhg0rV8AtH57lZRI3XEQfy+2mU+4RKEIqRPiFbjhW+8wDpYfM2\nsG9NjCAEPpRhppJoAWvXVHUaf8htClRIR+eTCXO4SU3awhry5TnGOisJ8yr74sgc\nuaEi1kGo7pKZo1wdywiQ3jrJpNxSGOvpwnoYlc0Us1N/an/ZpotTYc2UcHnWqfDE\nZAJTXWpDha0AvcwNgl3232dsG5dlce1/NG8dy5b8472UBzWskhKJIbvCBz04n5NZ\nDjAo2nI8+d65kAe5+T5Tgh/3/SU/kpGfUm7lkYyjWj1B5bT1FQ+Dy2xGyDmgWcSr\ncIy333mI/KfJdbNluT5xTv9xvWPwQA==\n=VyRF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T14:13:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/496cd44b842035592b2a52a1d7289510c0f4ad37","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKDQ5NmNkNDRiODQyMDM1NTkyYjJhNTJhMWQ3Mjg5NTEwYzBmNGFkMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/9b4606d99d50fe5acab325234a341f77d6a4c847","sha":"9b4606d99d50fe5acab325234a341f77d6a4c847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/9b4606d99d50fe5acab325234a341f77d6a4c847"}],"sha":"496cd44b842035592b2a52a1d7289510c0f4ad37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/496cd44b842035592b2a52a1d7289510c0f4ad37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/9b4606d99d50fe5acab325234a341f77d6a4c847/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T13:49:17Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T13:49:17Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(bflp): bucket audit entries explicitly under yyyy/MM/dd\n\nEven with jmix:autoSplitFolders + j:splitConfig correctly applied to the\nauditLog container, entries kept landing flat in production. Jahia''s\nauto-split runtime hooks into specific addNode call paths and is sensitive\nto how the parent was resolved, so we cannot rely on it from a system-session\nwrite.\n\nBuild the yyyy/MM/dd path ourselves in AuditLogger.log() with UTC dates and\naddNode under the deepest bucket. The mixin stays declared in the CND as a\ncontract for any external writer (e.g., admins creating audit entries via\nthe REST API). The reader''s recursive collectEntryNodes already walks\narbitrary intermediate folders, so list/trim/clear are unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"9eaddf31b360374cf04b26d773acc9112c592d97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/9eaddf31b360374cf04b26d773acc9112c592d97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/9b4606d99d50fe5acab325234a341f77d6a4c847","verification":{"payload":"tree 9eaddf31b360374cf04b26d773acc9112c592d97\nparent 2cf18356bb70634bb7ccfb4579bc092fdb258db1\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779457757 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779457757 +0200\n\nfix(bflp): bucket audit entries explicitly under yyyy/MM/dd\n\nEven with jmix:autoSplitFolders + j:splitConfig correctly applied to the\nauditLog container, entries kept landing flat in production. Jahia''s\nauto-split runtime hooks into specific addNode call paths and is sensitive\nto how the parent was resolved, so we cannot rely on it from a system-session\nwrite.\n\nBuild the yyyy/MM/dd path ourselves in AuditLogger.log() with UTC dates and\naddNode under the deepest bucket. The mixin stays declared in the CND as a\ncontract for any external writer (e.g., admins creating audit entries via\nthe REST API). The reader''s recursive collectEntryNodes already walks\narbitrary intermediate folders, so list/trim/clear are unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQXt0ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kxfQf/SxQA1ORYcbr9r3Slonb136X4ii11VYa2dNVqVfFoBMLI52zPLqjNZu2X\ngiTNqLJfIBoCemZf4G2WUQUVeP9S80oftArU4ertG3qA46erJdbsqDON8Hb+ZDvu\nXv4LoxmLqM3sEIVxAOw0vTr991NoMR2fclyYlZHkIfnffC0/hFeEQC6VmJR3Rimn\ntlhP//6IRRscFb4rm806M6zKRXFjFd2/bLtsveUU/NWvHUNvWlEdTWYuWJvGYsQv\nzoVuoqyOpH0lQW4GxvT4qACvMf4t1FxsOSY/2UDoZIz6q7/9nilblsc20XGrlWzs\nKDqb3qnYi5eCydNv2p7f7lyAeI/IKg==\n=sLt6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T14:13:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/9b4606d99d50fe5acab325234a341f77d6a4c847","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKDliNDYwNmQ5OWQ1MGZlNWFjYWIzMjUyMzRhMzQxZjc3ZDZhNGM4NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/2cf18356bb70634bb7ccfb4579bc092fdb258db1","sha":"2cf18356bb70634bb7ccfb4579bc092fdb258db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/2cf18356bb70634bb7ccfb4579bc092fdb258db1"}],"sha":"9b4606d99d50fe5acab325234a341f77d6a4c847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/9b4606d99d50fe5acab325234a341f77d6a4c847"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/2cf18356bb70634bb7ccfb4579bc092fdb258db1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T13:37:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T13:37:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(bflp): move autoSplitFolders mixin to the audit-log container\n\nThe mixin was on jnt:bruteForceLoginProtectionAuditEntry, which only sprayed\nj:splitConfig + j:splitNodeType onto each entry node — Jahia never read them.\nJCRSessionWrapper.addNode() inspects the *parent* for the autoSplitFolders\nmixin to compute the intermediate bucket path, so the mixin belongs on the\njnt:bruteForceLoginProtectionAuditLog container instead. A JCR export\nconfirmed entries were piling up flat under <auditLog> despite carrying the\nsplit-config properties.\n\nAudit-log containers created before this CND change won''t gain the mixin\nretroactively. SettingsService.getOrCreateSettingsNode now calls addMixin on\nthe existing node when missing, so upgrades pick up auto-splitting on the\nnext session without dropping /settings/bruteforceloginprotection/auditLog.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba0ab572fefcbd5e5122f4ef9fad6c096ce3e4a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/ba0ab572fefcbd5e5122f4ef9fad6c096ce3e4a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/2cf18356bb70634bb7ccfb4579bc092fdb258db1","verification":{"payload":"tree ba0ab572fefcbd5e5122f4ef9fad6c096ce3e4a2\nparent 3ff9a8c561c36d5a07cc0b70d14d13d00d9422f3\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779457077 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779457077 +0200\n\nfix(bflp): move autoSplitFolders mixin to the audit-log container\n\nThe mixin was on jnt:bruteForceLoginProtectionAuditEntry, which only sprayed\nj:splitConfig + j:splitNodeType onto each entry node — Jahia never read them.\nJCRSessionWrapper.addNode() inspects the *parent* for the autoSplitFolders\nmixin to compute the intermediate bucket path, so the mixin belongs on the\njnt:bruteForceLoginProtectionAuditLog container instead. A JCR export\nconfirmed entries were piling up flat under <auditLog> despite carrying the\nsplit-config properties.\n\nAudit-log containers created before this CND change won''t gain the mixin\nretroactively. SettingsService.getOrCreateSettingsNode now calls addMixin on\nthe existing node when missing, so upgrades pick up auto-splitting on the\nnext session without dropping /settings/bruteforceloginprotection/auditLog.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQXDUACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nY6wgA0LtzoDxqj1Fv5n3HR1k8b5/TFg1RBxwF97SxVb1B0pTbG5A7qbMZ2wPN\neaI3JoPQM4g35tPkSKdk66NJlUe/OAylBt4IUY5CEw0Yl5z45o7fHcD1bUQSmRMj\n/ionf8mSaWXbceO8kInKLplPGQeCyvg4nI659dEDICWWQjCIyx9zrt9wD1cN1oeU\nWf5f9oOukvwUZQ21TmJAtll1cHLEWNrsdz8Amlc7gS0e4llprWTjWsDkHMqWathH\n1SLBW2czPnk1ind9plpaVSttoK/cBIlFKaeUWFdLMZMNrdSQ4d+A7EXepSlOy3QX\nmA67ASJYotfuZfkPpE+e4oCy9/Bnyg==\n=Q5Eh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T14:13:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://a