label\neven when bruteForceLoginProtectionClusterStatus reported hazelcastRunning=true.\nCheck that Hazelcast is running and at least one node is reachable.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"0fe75bba7a50b0e67bced0878848f5ffadb7465b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/0fe75bba7a50b0e67bced0878848f5ffadb7465b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/fc46edf56ba6db4271c6d614ee24c9d618118134","verification":{"payload":"tree 0fe75bba7a50b0e67bced0878848f5ffadb7465b\nparent f0576e5761716dfbf9378d2f15568267169c50dc\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779451400 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779451400 +0200\n\nfix(bflp): treat single-node Hazelcast as healthy in cluster status bar\n\nThe ClusterStatusBar required nodeCount > 1 to render the healthy state,\nso a cluster-of-one (explicitly supported per AGENTS.md) always rendered\nas degraded with the ''Single-node fallback (Hazelcast unavailable)'' label\neven when bruteForceLoginProtectionClusterStatus reported hazelcastRunning=true.\nCheck that Hazelcast is running and at least one node is reachable.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoQRggACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mFlQf/Qxtq9Xc84KNfnuUf9EpFzEJuu1C/KHwHJxi0P7k3NN6At5O2nv9K8jPS\nqjdwA96z/X9qLfMdtNKQmdZU6M+fpYnixziRaFERnB1o2pmoGkSmlDRttWQcdgNu\nnRX5kqhu3BAX9SFtjQ8FU7CCCJBVM3SI74jnonIwP97iHSqk985ylzVpngi2vOVB\nZ4T2f3gaBw3a3eVPtAjkmS+EOT8utdqilEF3DPg9OkiPyN4Yl3O6kxg19aO4fw1L\nkhcxLrXivx7LCarDtKwaSAqvB1hUAuMbpFFrFFL84ptKGser59nd6taXBGWvbaSk\nOF+zHgQJWtKt8/E5LqAKOxwQLaki6Q==\n=9Fx5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T12:03:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbour