:"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/59ea1ab1679a144d2245cd301e2dc19f1fb916d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T06:34:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T06:34:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(bflp): use GlobalSerializerConfig instead of registering for Serializable\n\nHazelcast 3.x refuses to override its built-in JavaSerializer for the\njava.io.Serializable marker interface — registering a custom serializer\nagainst Serializable.class throws at node creation:\n\n  IllegalStateException: Serializer[JavaDefaultSerializers$JavaSerializer]\n  has been already registered for type: interface java.io.Serializable\n\nSwitch to the supported API: a GlobalSerializerConfig with\noverrideJavaSerialization=true. It replaces the default JDK serializer\nfor any class that doesn''t have an explicit serializer, which is exactly\nwhat the classloader-aware path needs — without colliding on the\nhardcoded typeId of ClassLoaderAwareSerializer or having to enumerate\nevery module value class by hand.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3cef63dec59868e49ff84ed3bf7b96e5124e923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/e3cef63dec59868e49ff84ed3bf7b96e5124e923"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/59ea1ab1679a144d2245cd301e2dc19f1fb916d6","verification":{"payload":"tree e3cef63dec59868e49ff84ed3bf7b96e5124e923\nparent 9c0c2727167eec5b327da10f80e11686ff069866\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779431668 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779431668 +0200\n\nfix(bflp): use GlobalSerializerConfig instead of registering for Serializable\n\nHazelcast 3.x refuses to override its built-in JavaSerializer for the\njava.io.Serializable marker interface — registering a custom serializer\nagainst Serializable.class throws at node creation:\n\n  IllegalStateException: Serializer[JavaDefaultSerializers$JavaSerializer]\n  has been already registered for type: interface java.io.Serializable\n\nSwitch to the supported API: a GlobalSerializerConfig with\noverrideJavaSerialization=true. It replaces the default JDK serializer\nfor any class that doesn''t have an explicit serializer, which is exactly\nwhat the classloader-aware path needs — without colliding on the\nhardcoded typeId of ClassLoaderAwareSerializer or having to enumerate\nevery module value class by hand.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoP+PQACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mzygf/VksziNKp1sAgCuShDZRrrodQRwG6a5HKawNAdP1lBUQ5YcYiC1PczIYA\nvBFUvAG6cnF6Wtl6GecA4LMNQ0ntkJ/Gl2ty3dYHZ/Kg9I/YzFHkvQ7kExVTJIac\nmtsIjrcZBLCHZfkgyprTIDX8wsvgON8xtO89AfIaUVeZ2xhJq3AqhkduEfc9MCTm\n/uhVloegh81ER5iP1Q7rkCvuUeQmWYfcbRf4xjnO0NzMheY1roTJ49Re1szqRBNK\ncW0UNmd9Rk/J4iWUI5TRsWjnAm62DYJPDMiL/C0eGChyrsX0AjINnVcIg9WAOmQB\nSY8I/YhZydQLTKPhVsgg2j+4Eawi2g==\n=BFRM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T11:52:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}",