eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/dd08e1ad87cc09ab895d15570acc46fd57e42fd6","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKGRkMDhlMWFkODdjYzA5YWI4OTVkMTU1NzBhY2M0NmZkNTdlNDJmZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/7ef4449eb06c82bced27d0171f04cdd1c52a381e","sha":"7ef4449eb06c82bced27d0171f04cdd1c52a381e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/7ef4449eb06c82bced27d0171f04cdd1c52a381e"}],"sha":"dd08e1ad87cc09ab895d15570acc46fd57e42fd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/dd08e1ad87cc09ab895d15570acc46fd57e42fd6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/7ef4449eb06c82bced27d0171f04cdd1c52a381e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T21:17:43Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T21:17:43Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: skip per-cache entry cap when EhCache manager uses a heap pool\n\nJahia''s EhCache manager configures maxBytesLocalHeap globally, which is\nincompatible with per-cache maxEntriesLocalHeap. The previous commit\nfailed at module activation with InvalidConfigurationException.\n\nDetect the manager''s heap-pool mode via getMaxBytesLocalHeap() and\nonly set the entry cap when no global pool is configured. When the\npool is active, the LRU eviction policy plus the pool itself bound\nmemory across all caches, preserving the DoS protection.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbe93139d85444345e76fa36c31b295ee768e41b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/dbe93139d85444345e76fa36c31b295ee768e41b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/7ef4449eb06c82bced27d0171f04cdd1c52a381e","verification":{"payload":"tree dbe93139d85444345e76fa36c31b295ee768e41b\nparent d5f06800a63855548e393ca9f567cae7f07af352\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778879863 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778879863 +0200\n\nfix: skip per-cache entry cap when EhCache manager uses a heap pool\n\nJahia''s EhCache manager configures maxBytesLocalHeap globally, which is\nincompatible with per-cache maxEntriesLocalHeap. The previous commit\nfailed at module activation with InvalidConfigurationException.\n\nDetect the manager''s heap-pool mode via getMaxBytesLocalHeap() and\nonly set the entry cap when no global pool is configured. When the\npool is active, the LRU eviction policy plus the pool itself bound\nmemory across all caches, preserving the DoS protection.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoHjXcACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kTAwgAoJap/q8mGMqM9QnWP5941fEBcpyIKNO1+FrUgY6a8RS8ODkqPC0T86MP\nvNXOCJ1qZxhdFUA/+8n1Etmy1TdXsh34OEL6dNFXsdW0kLeyDFkQr6J9L5E3H0aT\n16qQCLsQ08Y8KlOHavBwE/hQx1kT9dqNJ5GyytOr+rYpW5TGtVXjoWPFVZGVwJCJ\nTWqGgNtMZr6T+8NMvE2IAkLkO5Vhg/MEKyNKXm7Wk6Yh7e5tYOjdGSvux6/cG2Ew\n9AiNz1JQxVGS5i6ZDDDHHW7xBt51F0b4DJMNX3nLo57Ln9eBAvnUndV3coXCTnc7\n7IC8BDzBLIU+6agH2fB+B2lUIKTOWg==\n=m0kk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T21:22:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/7ef4449eb06c82bced27d0171f04cdd1c52a381e","node_id":"C_kwDODN31CNoAKDdlZjQ0NDllYjA2YzgyYmNlZDI3ZDAxNzFmMDRjZGQxYzUyYTM4MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commit/d5f06800a63855548e393ca9f567cae7f07af352","sha":"d5f06800a63855548e393ca9f567cae7f07af352","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/d5f06800a63855548e393ca9f567cae7f07af352"}],"sha":"7ef4449eb06c82bced27d0171f04cdd1c52a381e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/7ef4449eb06c82bced27d0171f04cdd1c52a381e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/commits/d5f06800a63855548e393ca9f567cae7f07af352/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T21:09:30Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T21:09:30Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(security): harden brute-force login protection against bypass and DoS\n\n- Make X-Forwarded-For trust opt-in via new trust_x_forwarded_for setting\n  (default false), preventing attackers from rotating the header to evade\n  the failed-login counter and pollute the cache with arbitrary keys.\n- Drop the /cms/login URI restriction so the valve also protects GraphQL\n  login, j_security_check, basic-auth, and other authentication paths.\n- Switch failed-login counter and notification flag to AtomicInteger /\n  AtomicBoolean to fix the under-count race under concurrent attempts.\n- Cap EhCache at 100k entries with LRU eviction to bound memory under\n  attack.\n- Replace shared SimpleDateFormat with thread-safe DateTimeFormatter.\n- Validate whitelist CIDR entries in saveSettings; reject invalid input.\n- Add cross-eviction email-alert throttle (1h window) via a sibling\n  cache marker, preventing alert-flood amplification.\n- Sanitize all attacker-controllable fields (remoteAddress, serverName,\n  site) when logging, and switch to SLF4J parameterized logging.\n- Fix typos in the blocked-IP alert email.\n\nQuality gate: OK (0 new security/reliability/maintainability issues).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"174c10f3c3bb5de946c5cd4d78280b0fb4d0f131","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/trees/174c10f3c3bb5de946c5cd4d78280b0fb4d0f131"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/brute-force-login-protection/git/commits/d5f06800a63855548e393ca9f567cae7f07af352","verification":{"payload":"tree 174c10f3c3bb5de946c5cd4d78280b0fb4d0f131\nparent 3c3e051a79b41c77cecc5cf3820175073a91f193\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778879370 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778879370 +0200\n\nfix(security): harden brute-force login protection against bypass and DoS\n\n- Make X-Forwarded-For trust opt-in via new trust_x_forwarded_for setting\n  (default false), preventing attackers from rotating the header to evade\n  the failed-login counter and pollute the cache with arbitrary keys.\n- Drop the /cms/login URI restriction so the valve also protects GraphQL\n  login, j_security_check, basic-auth, and other authentication paths.\n- Switch failed-login counter and notification flag to AtomicInteger /\n  AtomicBoolean to fix the under-count race under concurrent attempts.\n- Cap EhCache at 100k entries with LRU eviction to bound memory under\n  attack.\n- Replace shared SimpleDateFormat with thread-safe DateTimeFormatter.\n- Validate whitelist CIDR entries in saveSettings; reject invalid input.\n- Add cross-eviction email-alert throttle (1h window) via a sibling\n  cache marker, preventing alert-flood amplification.\n- Sanitize all attacker-controllable fields (remoteAddress, serverName,\n  site) when logging, and switch to SLF4J parameterized logging.\n- Fix typos in the blocked-IP alert email.\n\nQuality gate: OK (0 new security/reliability/maintainability issues).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoHi4oACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nJUwgAhw4aH/1b4imrlI28lADh/jyZU84EjnMYL2MT9kNBpHbCsTS7GONGdj3S\nBu+fTzwhEpDjahMJz/YhTDlAgrSXagVBHUTPtW8SXqqdrYM4eGrFNeEHazc+D6Jp\nNgl9K6iLAtTOazFNq64YvvPVzp6/hZ4G7T4jzHzVu0cTGG9o4ojri84hgb+MS4LP\nUG4XQhUy1IVEt5UOI/E29nh1QsImWAnorWLWAk8pdxOE2ERak5XIt+fcylH+tPN5\nWAJ9sQIUFYT4rjzKiveSADEOuQv/D59y1h2ZU3iQrGWnwjJMuL2RGyVxBkhzT00f\nP9M4F73tsXf5e4P+9Hlg8OBLsnn7lw==\n=CpgZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T21:22:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_ur