s","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/e68bc99f5c91387e552845c021c91015c7f9b0d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:15Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a tomcatLog namespace container (#17)\n\nMove the 2 root Query (tomcatLogSettings/Tail) + 1 root Mutation (tomcatLogSaveSettings)\nflat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    tomcatLogSettings -> tomcatLog { settings }, tomcatLogTail -> { tail }\n- Mutation: tomcatLogSaveSettings -> tomcatLog { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types TomcatLogProviderQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (the GqlSettings return type moves into the query holder); the\n*Extension classes keep a single tomcatLog accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission\nstays on each leaf. TomcatLogTailTest repointed to the instance method on the holder.\nFrontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e3d60346b7632c92564e72750f33359ffd87507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/trees/8e3d60346b7632c92564e72750f33359ffd87507"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/commits/e68bc99f5c91387e552845c021c91015c7f9b0d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e3d60346b7632c92564e72750f33359ffd87507\nparent dccab841f5b0188d1609a3031d75312aaf9463d4\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782027015 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782027015 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a tomcatLog namespace container (#17)\n\nMove the 2 root Query (tomcatLogSettings/Tail) + 1 root Mutation (tomcatLogSaveSettings)\nflat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    tomcatLogSettings -> tomcatLog { settings }, tomcatLogTail -> { tail }\n- Mutation: tomcatLogSaveSettings -> tomcatLog { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types TomcatLogProviderQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (the GqlSettings return type moves into the query holder); the\n*Extension classes keep a single tomcatLog accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission\nstays on each leaf. TomcatLogTailTest repointed to the instance method on the holder.\nFrontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5MHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArq4QAKUxjjvHyjgUgIL1Nptnugos\nrsSvzOdQS9x0zJ/0fCUmPP3uI9nY2Ui5jwPVh+H0qtKxvt/B3WLhSCLV48iZ7eEy\nVcZVZyu/33xNPZkriZLYA9T4GZ4WhFVeIx+qRvNWw+cSFDi0cTzEes/g11/b/fl7\nl5Occ90LAHbUntGLdf+TUkBsrlUbgxhJS+68ivCHN6gepAXL99yF2UPxL1c1/02K\nanwjiacwGfqP94bUGdyNxVGK/Efxn0+bFUPtGEFaWRzQrP2/tRzVp8Oug5oO9nb9\n7axGOxKEYEM20/rWRYT0khWWWSpDkT3a+6v4cyTFt1f9gmnX/dlv8V2t1olqNTbj\nU8f7jVxPsHtKdRXex6oe3zOzuGwaZ73SEyzzY+4ChY7J8LZxqPeh4DQyToc1d+OQ\noVmsRW2o3LDz1hljgKwfmKhdMQYc/cp73nF1Ty/nUX7cOnzKqPibxRRx9exQvBIJ\nsBanNBnfjUOQr6ASKMIHpq9pMBXzfPWlFtfNBj4VfyY3lUf6Mgzjd6L3KRa6tHIb\nBmJSTSX08PZmDRYBIqpgQ3vZMaWYC2nTTCA7pP92jEceNymwPEtgZWdZo60wwBc4\nk3QnX6lJYVoNRSF/HjE5ZPffLFyf8zupQwT9/5dlh65kcRJJKM2qmJ/2ZLuCaskz\nA4e6ro3nX2KRRSaW9oqG\n=5xMh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-21T07:30:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https