url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/fcda03f5bb16deb32eb3db5242ba96069dbc97dd"}],"sha":"dccab841f5b0188d1609a3031d75312aaf9463d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/dccab841f5b0188d1609a3031d75312aaf9463d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/fcda03f5bb16deb32eb3db5242ba96069dbc97dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:56Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#10)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the fine-grained tomcatLogProviderAdmin\npermission across the full stack:\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: ship an assignable\n  tomcat-log-provider-administrator server role granting only\n  administrationAccess + tomcatLogProviderAdmin (no full admin).\n- tests/cypress/e2e/02-tomcatLogProvider-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests\n  proving granularity with a user granted ONLY that role:\n    * GraphQL: denies tomcatLogSettings for a user without the perm\n      (Permission denied) and allows it (full data) for the granted user.\n    * Admin UI: hides /jahia/administration/tomcatLogProvider from the\n      denied user and shows it to the granted user.\n- TomcatLogDataSource.getPrivilegesNames(): relax the inner server-level\n  hardcoded getNode(\"/\").hasPermission(\"admin\") check to\n  tomcatLogProviderAdmin so the fine-grained role grants read access to\n  the mounted log nodes end-to-end (per-site checks untouched).\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.0.6 -> 2.0.7-SNAPSHOT so the updated\n  import content (roles.xml) is re-imported on deploy.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"66a44bbb2b2616a2aff51f113070cda056e56d20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/trees/66a44bbb2b2616a2aff51f113070cda056e56d20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/commits/fcda03f5bb16deb32eb3db5242ba96069dbc97dd","verification":{"payload":"tree 66a44bbb2b2616a2aff51f113070cda056e56d20\nparent 3d130e3171eabac8c5f76ccebb88e511190dd4c2\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781118416 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781118416 +0200\n\ntest: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#10)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the fine-grained tomcatLogProviderAdmin\npermission across the full stack:\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: ship an assignable\n  tomcat-log-provider-administrator server role granting only\n  administrationAccess + tomcatLogProviderAdmin (no full admin).\n- tests/cypress/e2e/02-tomcatLogProvider-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests\n  proving granularity with a user granted ONLY that role:\n    * GraphQL: denies tomcatLogSettings for a user without the perm\n      (Permission denied) and allows it (full data) for the granted user.\n    * Admin UI: hides /jahia/administration/tomcatLogProvider from the\n      denied user and shows it to the granted user.\n- TomcatLogDataSource.getPrivilegesNames(): relax the inner server-level\n  hardcoded getNode(\"/\").hasPermission(\"admin\") check to\n  tomcatLogProviderAdmin so the fine-grained role grants read access to\n  the mounted log nodes end-to-end (per-site checks untouched).\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.0.6 -> 2.0.7-SNAPSHOT so the updated\n  import content (roles.xml) is re-imported on deploy.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKbXQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAy8kQAGWWG5Atk9vF4faeyir7h2Pa\nr+x8c3pEFwWiaa61SSUsJq3L8Xdo1OLS5KAIZPq5UWjiSF36Irvmf2Bo/4cfAXuT\nVuPsXoD8wm0T4Mr7+wRjIEB9JlmY+dMKBuF0hX90ZNP6yafiaCAJ/9nSzBc0JCzj\nAOQ2rPbhCDKwJm3cWbcMoGfK0mOLr8K1zuXV23UkBthiP8YfOKGaf9Jl0I5cDmlm\nLfC2hvke4hAStHoT9Y0Lk+4Jb6vn2YTiqjfDVdv1D4RX3MW3QVSE5jZsY6aEqn1O\nJ+ypCW5HR/6O/guOYCjtv3XWWZag9pBeZmDwPwv5ncf4+d/3sYj6WjQn6csS0KsD\nbfQirYoJfHDQj+YTgyo30sEeOu1bIFsO11PO4+ApGPQHk7mCPLDgy1R/4f17z3MS\nNvmz5JXbyiBLHPJ2embftlk6YWtQlk/nv6sN50oXPKaCfLBbCdRW8/G8/zb49TSJ\ncTZAGaofTJSigC7FYTYamMTgyKhqpuITDtnKOmgXElHZybp14N69theFQ2Ym3HDi\n+35ac5n/OTkhTQVk6N/fYZ3rEyvcmXrO4tHBhLBe0FAXSRi5Ydj/WoWdq/NChzfT\nJ6fQu5ydFqj5bHQDHvilBiiDSxxJ/PBGhYt9rMHrNtx4grP9Uu10T/y4yNPKfnY2\nZdgD0IDvJIp9NhX2O5Fl\n=7Dm2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T19:06:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com