},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/3d130e3171eabac8c5f76ccebb88e511190dd4c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:41:34Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:41:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add module-specific tomcatLogProviderAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC (#9)\n\n* feat: add module-specific tomcatLogProviderAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC\n\nDefine tomcatLogProviderAdmin as a JCR child permission of admin in\nsrc/main/import/permissions.xml so non-admin users can be granted only\nthis module permission. Update all three @GraphQLRequiresPermission\nannotations from \"admin\" to \"tomcatLogProviderAdmin\"; full admins retain\naccess via JCR privilege inheritance.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: update requiredPermission to module-specific permission in frontend registration\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3085bd44cc07dc9e9ebcd32850ecc910e801cf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/trees/b3085bd44cc07dc9e9ebcd32850ecc910e801cf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/commits/3d130e3171eabac8c5f76ccebb88e511190dd4c2","verification":{"payload":"tree b3085bd44cc07dc9e9ebcd32850ecc910e801cf7\nparent e5490ace792b0dc3b542bb1badd15d60ed475c85\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781084494 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781084494 +0200\n\nfeat: add module-specific tomcatLogProviderAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC (#9)\n\n* feat: add module-specific tomcatLogProviderAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC\n\nDefine tomcatLogProviderAdmin as a JCR child permission of admin in\nsrc/main/import/permissions.xml so non-admin users can be granted only\nthis module p