e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/6df01c527544bf6e79e1e8ba4622d55b36c5366c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:59:29Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:59:29Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: strengthen path containment and null safety in tomcat-log-provider\n\nS1/R1 TomcatLogDataSource.getFile: add canonical-path containment so a\n  symlink planted inside the log root cannot expose files outside it\n  (string-prefix check alone did not follow symlinks).\nS2/R2 TomcatLogDataSource.getContentType: guard against null\n  getContentInfo() before dereferencing (consistent with getFile()).\nS3/R3 TomcatLogDataSource.getItemByIdentifier/getItemByPath/itemExists:\n  null/blank argument guards at the JCR trust boundary (no NPE).\nS4/R4 TomcatLogBinaryImpl.read: reject null buffer and negative position;\n  make fileContent final (immutability).\nS5/R5 Replace magic strings with named constants (DEFAULT_CONTENT_TYPE,\n  IMAGE_CONTENT_TYPE_PATTERN).\n\nTests (JUnit 5 + AssertJ, test-scope only):\n- TomcatLogDataSourcePathContainmentTest (7): traversal, symlink escape,\n  blank path, itemExists null safety.\n- TomcatLogTailTest (4): bounded tail, default/cap, missing file.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0bc96d75ad1104d521c1676aeae039167235bad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/trees/a0bc96d75ad1104d521c1676aeae039167235bad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/commits/6df01c527544bf6e79e1e8ba4622d55b36c5366c","verification":{"payload":"tree a0bc96d75ad1104d521c1676aeae039167235bad\nparent 9364af43b9ca9622ff1f116e801fdc5d5afe9e4a\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781071169 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781071169 +0200\n\nfix: strengthen path containment and null safety in tomcat-log-provider\n\nS1/R1 TomcatLogDataSource.getFile: add canonical-path containment so a\n  symlink planted inside the log root cannot expose files outside it\n  (string-prefix check alone did not follow symlinks).\nS2/R2 TomcatLogDataSource.getContentType: guard against null\n  getContentInfo() before dereferencing (consistent with getFile()).\nS3/R3 TomcatLogDataSource.getItemByIdentifier/getItemByPath/itemExists:\n  null/blank argument guards at the JCR trust boundary (no NPE).\nS4/R4 TomcatLogBinaryImpl.read: reject null buffer and negative position;\n  make fileContent final (immutability).\nS5/R5 Replace magic strings with named constants (DEFAULT_CONTENT_TYPE,\n  IMAGE_CONTENT_TYPE_PATTERN).\n\nTests (JUnit 5 + AssertJ, test-scope only):\n- TomcatLogDataSourcePathContainmentTest (7): traversal, symlink escape,\n  blank path, itemExists null safety.\n- TomcatLogTailTest (4): bounded tail, default/cap, missing file.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoo/UEACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mzbwf9FO7ooSHa2wK+BLIpdCZTCUHkQjcqPGM5Kaig+0BFk8Pq7AIRd0B9Z3b+\nf0Lf/wSZPXvxV+4qqsfBG89EKUGJ25/iLHBksmL/B