b9ca9622ff1f116e801fdc5d5afe9e4a","node_id":"C_kwDODQ4Q8toAKDkzNjRhZjQzYjljYTk2MjJmZjFmMTE2ZTgwMWZkYzVkNWFmZTllNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commit/95e59ed3ddf8270f6446d2bfb166289310a8e73b","sha":"95e59ed3ddf8270f6446d2bfb166289310a8e73b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/95e59ed3ddf8270f6446d2bfb166289310a8e73b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commit/bceff0f785ad19187c4e9ffa4fd7ca4bc327579d","sha":"bceff0f785ad19187c4e9ffa4fd7ca4bc327579d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/bceff0f785ad19187c4e9ffa4fd7ca4bc327579d"}],"sha":"9364af43b9ca9622ff1f116e801fdc5d5afe9e4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/9364af43b9ca9622ff1f116e801fdc5d5afe9e4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/bceff0f785ad19187c4e9ffa4fd7ca4bc327579d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:49:14Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:49:14Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: remediate HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW findings from support review\n\n- [HIGH] Cap tomcatLogTail `lines` param at MAX_TAIL_LINES=5000 to prevent\n  unbounded heap allocations under polling (DoS).\n- [HIGH/BUG] Fix TomcatLogBinaryImpl.read(): was passing `position` as buffer\n  offset to InputStream.read() instead of seeking to that file position.\n  Now skips `position` bytes before reading into the buffer from offset 0.\n- [MEDIUM] Null-guard System.getProperty(\"catalina.base\") in\n  TomcatLogDataSource.getTomcatLogPath(); logTail and settings() now return a\n  clean empty result / null log path instead of a NullPointerException stack\n  trace leaking through GraphQL when catalina.base is absent.\n- [HIGH/CONVENTION] Fix OSGi cfg sentinel comment: s/overriden/overridden/ so\n  Jahia''s module extender recognises the exact marker and does not overwrite\n  operator configuration on redeploy.\n- [LOW] Guard null return from JCRSessionFactory.getCurrentUserSession() in\n  getPrivilegesNames() to prevent silent NPE; use JCRSessionWrapper type so\n  getNode(\"/\").hasPermission() resolves on the Jahia wrapper, not bare JCR Node.\n- [LOW] Remove production console.error in TomcatLogProvider.jsx handleSave\n  catch block.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ddb780f2504c8d75c3015d3a5c19e7d07bbb247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/trees/1ddb780f2504c8d75c3015d3a5c19e7d07bbb247"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/commits/bceff0f785ad19187c4e9ffa4fd7ca4bc327579d","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ddb780f2504c8d75c3015d3a5c19e7d07bbb247\nparent 95e59ed3ddf8270f6446d2bfb166289310a8e73b\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750154 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750154 +0200\n\nfix: remediate HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW findings from support review\n\n- [HIGH] Cap tomcatLogTail `lines` param at MAX_TAIL_LINES=5000 to prevent\n  unbounded heap allocations under polling (DoS).\n- [HIGH/BUG] Fix TomcatLogBinaryImpl.read(): was passing `position` as buffer\n  offset to InputStream.read() instead of seeking to that file position.\n  Now skips `position` bytes before reading into the buffer from offset 0.\n- [MEDIUM] Null-guard System.getProperty(\"catalina.base\") in\n  TomcatLogDataSource.getTomcatLogPath(); logTail and settings() now return a\n  clean empty result / null log path instead of a NullPointerException stack\n  trace leaking through GraphQL when catalina.base is absent.\n- [HIGH/CONVENTION] Fix OSGi cfg sentinel comment: s/overriden/overridden/ so\n  Jahia''s module extender recognises the exact marker and does not overwrite\n  operator configuration on redeploy.\n- [LOW] Guard null return from JCRSessionFactory.getCurrentUserSession() in\n  getPrivilegesNames() to prevent silent NPE; use JCRSessionWrapper type so\n  getNode(\"/\").hasPermission() resolves on the Jahia wrapper, not bare JCR Node.\n- [LOW] Remove production console.error in TomcatLogProvider.jsx handleSave\n  catch block.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokF0oACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3k7iggAvABwbG0jLrTlCrlf09Q99f5boceo861RrDqaR0LL1ywepXdEN+b918E7\n7MhKm6LcF+s4iijomV0PIK+dIbQWhhjkcMX8BRdLNOlEV9ALkrgOPj+TXK4jggsH\nPj1wo7Et8r1Xmkdvf+Mn2jbdjhCK85Q0K3NizknGEhtHUIHRjZxHMxLVp/r3Ot89\nO+ZhYmEBvhlsxaOcThgvjUcb5P+m45+WtCc8iG/LgxBll5ZzAVQhUfx2V821Nf9o\nHqZZnwYLSwXy+UANJJevvTd0zPVNMAot98UT1g4IZkrAOCChYx+2e7BarsgRYCcU\nwJ/wKlnUult1YTIMbmmC1oxzDI31MQ==\n=66uS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:38:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/pr