vy which creates localhost_access_log.2026-01-22T14:15:28.log\ninside the Jahia container''s Tomcat log directory at test startup. Wire it\ninto provisioning.yml via executeScript. Add a Cypress test case that\nasserts the file is accessible as a jnt:file node via the JCR GraphQL API\nusing its percent-encoded path (%3A for '':''), preventing regressions of\nthe MalformedPathException fix.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoPO1sACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mubwf/SdIx1tFg+T2zVb1P6FdcdZhhekwY07F5UDCvVo443SMba9hagtEuOLRU\nifexNF/7DgXa0CpB9/3czlRJyKu4fN4ne+2994aaWczbjWRn+u5BjJg8tSFQTyLd\n6ch4C+WqkOCpLHpkea6gF6hqnNzD/ZzLV5ZtVyHC9F50sHaK9aQqoc2b4B7bFs10\nQxLL6NsZVdCwmaFMYKnoBVIKAj4+yp9uA6b9piW6WLBx+5ikDI1X99S5vEkP0mw1\nTcJn1/qNs9hCb+JX2q7BtXiX64WahhEslN78jURid7E52oiNQFEYm/+yRTFUhRoE\nAfTxXXgaH1/lHwxmzBJIQ3TZ6yc2Bg==\n=VaIO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-21T17:22:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commit/4c68d70ef0cd0f8d53dc28d406ef983eb37e08c7","node_id":"C_kwDODQ4Q8toAKDRjNjhkNzBlZjBjZDBmOGQ1M2RjMjhkNDA2ZWY5ODNlYjM3ZTA4Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commit/afa8ec782adaa3e8593bb6b14b94b411e55325cf","sha":"afa8ec782adaa3e8593bb6b14b94b411e55325cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/afa8ec782adaa3e8593bb6b14b94b411e55325cf"}],"sha":"4c68d70ef0cd0f8d53dc28d406ef983eb37e08c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/4c68d70ef0cd0f8d53dc28d406ef983eb37e08c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/commits/afa8ec782adaa3e8593bb6b14b94b411e55325cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T17:03:20Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T17:03:20Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: replace JCRContentUtils escaping with targeted Escaping utility class\n\nIntroduce package-private Escaping class that encodes only characters\ngenuinely illegal in JCR unqualified names ([]*|:), deliberately leaving\n% untouched to prevent double-encoding of paths VFS2 has already\npercent-encoded (e.g. colons in ISO 8601 timestamps become %3A from VFS2;\nescapeLocalNodeName would then re-encode % to %25, producing %253A and\ncausing MalformedPathException in Jackrabbit''s path parser).\n\nReplace JCRContentUtils.escapeNodePath() in getFile(FileObject) and\ngetFileContent() with a new toJcrPath() helper that escapes per path\nsegment. Replace escapeLocalNodeName() in listFolderChildNames() with\nEscaping.escapeIllegalJcrChars(). Replace unescapeLocalNodeName() in\ngetItemByPath() with Escaping.unescapeIllegalJcrChars() for consistency.\n\nAlso migrate getPrivilegesNames() from the deprecated\nServicesRegistry -> JahiaGroupManagerService.isAdminMember() to\nJCRSessionFactory.getInstance().getCurrentUserSession().hasPermission(\"admin\").\nRemove wildcard vfs2 import and unused imports (ServicesRegistry,\nJahiaSitesService, JCRUserNode, JahiaUserManagerService).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b461a5c078dce258440e6a388b9d5a07128f2a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/trees/7b461a5c078dce258440e6a388b9d5a07128f2a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/commits/afa8ec782adaa3e8593bb6b14b94b411e55325cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 7b461a5c078dce258440e6a388b9d5a07128f2a9\nparent 88e9aa53c69e12bd4b16acf6b5cd65feb4b53a2c\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779383000 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779383000 +0200\n\nfix: replace JCRContentUtils escaping with targeted Escaping utility class\n\nIntroduce package-private Escaping class that encodes only characters\ngenuinely illegal in JCR unqualified names ([]*|:), deliberately leaving\n% untouched to prevent double-encoding of paths VFS2 has already\npercent-encoded (e.g. colons in ISO 8601 timestamps become %3A from VFS2;\nescapeLocalNodeName would then re-encode % to %25, producing %253A and\ncausing MalformedPathException in Jackrabbit''s path parser).\n\nReplace JCRContentUtils.escapeNodePath() in getFile(FileObject) and\ngetFileContent() with a new toJcrPath() helper that escapes per path\nsegment. Replace escapeLocalNodeName() in listFolderChildNames() with\nEscaping.escapeIllegalJcrChars(). Replace unescapeLocalNodeName() in\ngetItemByPath() with Escaping.unescapeIllegalJcrChars() for consistency.\n\nAlso migrate getPrivilegesNames() from the deprecated\nServicesRegistry -> JahiaGroupManagerService.isAdminMember() to\nJCRSessionFactory.getInstance().getCurrentUserSession().hasPermission(\"admin\").\nRemove wildcard vfs2 import and unused imports (ServicesRegistry,\nJahiaSitesService, JCRUserNode, JahiaUserManagerService).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoPOtgACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lsagf9H88nQfXeBQWbkQHfovfdsGxZ+5ilhA264czFB7zLc1ApeRFJkGSCQ6gt\nvh+elBWZSu4NJ5kqfgM0w89c20kB8UCKJ886+kKIgGO37w8KygSprHxMvhUesQAW\ndibS3OabLM9JiRtgPr2ZcoEAL5QR0tJKxMmkY5EsbrpbyK9dkIs8uwrqievyGtcl\nu6x412avp8pLcR0G5W04Gvhx9XP5YHjTLSWIbP+74PvYrfRAH9vBezm4dLFsZAAr\nXrSlSYVzrWeThctm1SXEOjnIQKmgXe57+S5gZSgs/UuqpfQUNoW1tEWzIVqcd7or\nQgurP9scM71x44R5lDZxPeps0aQh3A==\n=8seG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-21T17:22:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":1623