ogDataSource.getFile\n\nDefense-in-depth: verify that the VFS-resolved file stays under the\nconfigured Tomcat logs root before returning it, so JCR paths containing\n''..'' segments cannot escape the allow-listed log directory.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"c648913e37601acc670c94fba611a9c5dd1c3d9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/trees/c648913e37601acc670c94fba611a9c5dd1c3d9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/tomcat-log-provider/git/commits/76585b2c229793e84b8eb4d197f7e0683c1f9b9a","verification":{"payload":"tree c648913e37601acc670c94fba611a9c5dd1c3d9d\nparent 5d416b9b84d9b8e4d1e2af51698a796e517b2eaa\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778938980 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778938980 +0200\n\nReject path traversal attempts in TomcatLogDataSource.getFile\n\nDefense-in-depth: verify that the VFS-resolved file stays under the\nconfigured Tomcat logs root before returning it, so JCR paths containing\n''..'' segments cannot escape the allow-listed log directory.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoIdGQACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lbuAf/VDrbpuJRiCg7Fcjfcmkb3XKXDOSGHUJCvzthoMgQQpKqR6lRnWyq27XV\neISYxtlTzgN6y7d0xmSrmHjER8SyVN7dDHyvaJSoJyhHNWIBHyqWIcXa/l1f0IWv\nMDrl2KPB+o//Sk+lN32oybH26uFPUALihfu+n0/w6Td0TG+RQU3Qbry3D/u8EQrs\nRwolygCfzrAgXDSuhSieSOJEnTdGIls26toIz/p8YR1ikseg4zyRvaLHCmVVHITR\n+fYkAzwyxoI+B/NhQBiHugSYg91g9PrRhrHxb77Smlf5XzE13H4IQe6UTCgQjtXm\n0qsy8V6NyAVx85SboH7CpdLMTeKNYg==\n=jHx+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T11:14:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.