owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commits/d330c9dac126f106cef603e9baf42582cca5fac5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:33:37Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:33:37Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"test: add e2e coverage for login with a generated support token\n\nNew spec 04 drives the real auth pipeline via a restMode form login to\n/cms/login with the token in the password field, asserting on the\nunauthorized response body:\n- valid token authenticates a custom user\n- valid token authenticates root (ACL/system-session regression)\n- expired token (expiration 0) is refused\n- token matching no stored hash is refused\n- user with no tokens is refused\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d8daf33bfe4b45d271b8b7ee4b24c360c2f9e8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/7d8daf33bfe4b45d271b8b7ee4b24c360c2f9e8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/d330c9dac126f106cef603e9baf42582cca5fac5","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d8daf33bfe4b45d271b8b7ee4b24c360c2f9e8c\nparent 9257b3c058f6a55c4687f66537c18e48ef22fe1a\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783611217 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783611217 +0200\n\ntest: add e2e coverage for login with a generated support token\n\nNew spec 04 drives the real auth pipeline via a restMode form login to\n/cms/login with the token in the password field, asserting on the\nunauthorized response body:\n- valid token authenticates a custom user\n- valid token authenticates root (ACL/system-session regression)\n- expired token (expiration 0) is refused\n- token matching no stored hash is refused\n- user with no tokens is refused\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpPv1EACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3l6kgf9FOIk1ERBmL+wuXHhLp0Vcy1597Ld71shNEYsT/2/AYxOoUfwrkCpjnTR\nOnI9bVxcKHeeGwbn+Jhisx85F7c0pKVWYw+xzxJqd6xNmElY4VWWI4XBhSzn8dgc\naWwNGmy9r91gTuPd8cwqi9tdyq8oW0FvIWiwBOmknyW3QBjl7KiCCA4Tw/mXD0NL\nm7fr0DR/GkMfhd25fzEtwGXcmr8yUnGzfjlZwL65dbiAQlaQtpxTa+MoiT7dKagg\nmekHJDyc2450TYP5+Jnc4eob3MDEcM+t7S4FTZp5ig41ySxVmITY1ZMUKqp1RT/B\nI/sqPkYSTX1ge0Gs/h2cVIX/fe8TQw==\n=8r5I\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T15:33:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commit/d330c9dac126f106cef603e9baf42582cca5fac5","node_id":"C_kwDODSHTqtoAKGQzMzBjOWRhYzEyNmYxMDZjZWY2MDNlOWJhZjQyNTgyY2NhNWZhYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commit/9257b3c058f6a55c4687f66537c18e48ef22fe1a","sha":"9257b3c058f6a55c4687f66537c18e48ef22fe1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commits/9257b3c058f6a55c4687f66537c18e48ef22fe1a"}],"sha":"d330c9dac126f106cef603e9baf42582cca5fac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commits/d330c9dac126f106cef603e9baf42582cca5fac5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commits/9257b3c058f6a55c4687f66537c18e48ef22fe1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:33:31Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:33:31Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: authenticate support-token login for ACL-restricted users (root)\n\nverifyPassword read the token history off the node returned by the\nunprivileged lookupUser bound to the login request. The root user node\nis ACL-restricted, so that session could not see its tokenHistory child\nand login was refused with BAD_PASSWORD, while regular users worked.\nToken creation always succeeded because addToken uses a system session,\nproducing the ''works for a custom user but not root'' asymmetry.\n\nRead the token history through JCRTemplate.doExecuteWithSystemSession\n(with a session-scoped lookupUser), consistent with addToken/list/clear.\nReading with elevated rights is safe here: the caller has already\npresented the token, so this only confirms a credential.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"539fc38191ab8aab4129d01716bc9291361a81ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/539fc38191ab8aab4129d01716bc9291361a81ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/9257b3c058f6a55c4687f66537c18e48ef22fe1a","verification":{"payload":"tree 539fc38191ab8aab4129d01716bc9291361a81ea\nparent 49786799ba564e99205600f774a5c6ad24e00d02\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783611211 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783611211 +0200\n\nfix: authenticate support-token login for ACL-restricted users (root)\n\nverifyPassword read the token history off the node returned by the\nunprivileged lookupUser bound to the login request. The root user node\nis ACL-restricted, so that session could not see its tokenHistory child\nand login was refused with BAD_PASSWORD, while regular users worked.\nToken creation always succeeded because addToken uses a system session,\nproducing the ''works for a custom user but not root'' asymmetry.\n\nRead the token history through JCRTemplate.doExecuteWithSystemSession\n(with a session-scoped lookupUser), consistent with addToken/list/clear.\nReading with elevated rights is safe here: the caller has already\npresented the token, so this only confirms a credential.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signatu