email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T12:55:43Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: move admin scrollbar to window edge via full-width scroll host\n\nThe vertical scrollbar rendered in the middle of the window because it\nattached to the 800px-capped .st_container. Make .st_container a\nfull-width scroll host (height:100% + overflow-y:auto) and move the\npadding + max-width:800px cap onto a new inner .st_content wrapper, so\nthe scrollbar now sits at the window''s right edge while content stays\ncapped and left-aligned.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"1740a2972a639411288d3d96b8a4e31fbec45123","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/1740a2972a639411288d3d96b8a4e31fbec45123"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/eb0eff06b49ffd6ce5083176f91252277d656344","verification":{"payload":"tree 1740a2972a639411288d3d96b8a4e31fbec45123\nparent a664917e0a4e5a903e1eb7a4b6cf2c8c9ce25882\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783601743 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783601743 +0200\n\nfix: move admin scrollbar to window edge via full-width scroll host\n\nThe vertical scrollbar rendered in the middle of the window because it\nattached to the 800px-capped .st_container. Make .st_container a\nfull-width scroll host (height:100% + overflow-y:auto) and move the\npadding + max-width:800px cap onto a new inner .st_content wrapper, so\nthe scrollbar now sits at the window''s right edge while content stays\ncapped and left-aligned.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpPmk8ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3m5Mgf9G4a9ugx+GYrOlOSC6FRqcGWbaa5FjrGJ6W7TDMuX25kQqW+Zh03an/qT\nIDBwSFy8azJBPX1EoSUR/AT9JtMkNHnBFQ