lorent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"820f7fe41244a4d2860d9dca066b36c3adc3360b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/820f7fe41244a4d2860d9dca066b36c3adc3360b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/a664917e0a4e5a903e1eb7a4b6cf2c8c9ce25882","verification":{"payload":"tree 820f7fe41244a4d2860d9dca066b36c3adc3360b\nparent 52de12c9c4c97ba46406f1587a341a321987f166\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783601460 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783601460 +0200\n\nfeat: separate expired tokens table, sort newest-first, add scrollbar\n\n- Split the admin token list into separate Active and Expired tables,\n  computing expiry client-side (createdDate + expiration minutes) to\n  mirror the valve''s server-side check.\n- Sort tokens by creation date descending (newest first) via an\n  immutable copy, preserving the null sentinel for user-not-found.\n- Give the admin panel its own vertical scrollbar (height:100% +\n  overflow-y:auto) so long content is reachable inside Jahia''s\n  fixed-height admin route.\n- Fix pre-existing ESLint errors (nested-ternary indentation,\n  shorthand-prop ordering).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpPmTQACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3ldsgf+NRDSfJHiIkW+U7tvGRal5gtr+yqEI3DL6T6tmQ72GUMYRkXQg7W81J0z\nyg9wtvL8YklntY30FQPiibvTgxumMwmBjkaWKU2MZH2sBZBWmj2vGYmyReYi5YRF\nkV18W/qRWEXRSbulozNtnSTtJpMDRx6Umx23qtDETZmIuhkuxw5wuRyzxedwPvXJ\nwtfZJ40JBB/GO3vFJeKAKnje0h2/Hy6NA3zhwH/s6Vyq0P/xatUXo6jgLTs7ABSB\nRW/TfNo3ipjzSUCzj37e3fKnmcmLwDpeqmHK28Z3Y3M6hqz4SZWehtiwqaIPvn07\nZ3YK/kZPgJwlNRlzzdhaxkQKRZYBXA==\n=zVKK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T12:51:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://