ply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a supportToken namespace container (#16)\n\nMove the 1 root Query (supportTokenListTokens) + 2 root Mutation (supportTokenCreate,\nsupportTokenClearAll) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the\nJahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    supportTokenListTokens -> supportToken { listTokens }\n- Mutation: supportTokenCreate -> supportToken { create }, supportTokenClearAll -> { clearAll }\n\nNew holder types SupportTokenQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance @GraphQLField\nmethods (the GqlSupportTokenInfo return type moves into the query holder); the *Extension\nclasses keep a single supportToken accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each\nleaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b2f5dbd39524db421039588315af349e75ce09c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/7b2f5dbd39524db421039588315af349e75ce09c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/2692059ca65c5eb65a2c28e30842e8cdcc245400","verification":{"payload":"tree 7b2f5dbd39524db421039588315af349e75ce09c\nparent d17bcf44f787ba0099d24114c828562720cf4f63\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782026995 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782026995 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a supportToken namespace container (#16)\n\nMove the 1 root Query (supportTokenListTokens) + 2 root Mutation (supportTokenCreate,\nsupportTokenClearAll) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the\nJahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    supportTokenListTokens -> supportToken { listTokens }\n- Mutation: supportTokenCreate -> supportToken { create }, supportTokenClearAll -> { clearAll }\n\nNew holder types SupportTokenQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance 