e/commits/6c9405323a3f8161b9ece7e8ba09e833c445661d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:38Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#14)\n\nAdd Cypress regression coverage for the supportTokenAdmin permission across the\nwhole stack, plus an assignable server-level admin role so the permission can be\ngranted without full server-administrator rights.\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: ship support-token-authentication-valve-administrator\n  role granting only ''administrationAccess supportTokenAdmin''.\n- register.jsx: fix the server admin route requiredPermission from the wrong\n  ''adminUsers'' to ''supportTokenAdmin'' so the fine-grained role actually gates the\n  admin UI (the per-site route keeps ''siteAdminUsers'' — separate concern).\n- tests/cypress/e2e/03-supportToken-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests proving a user\n  granted ONLY the role (never ''admin'') is denied/allowed correctly:\n    * GraphQL: supportTokenListTokens denied for unprivileged user, allowed\n      (read-only) for the role-granted user.\n    * Admin UI: panel hidden for unprivileged user, visible for role-granted user.\n- pom.xml: bump module version 3.1.0-SNAPSHOT -> 3.1.1-SNAPSHOT (roles.xml import\n  content change requires a version bump to re-import).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b8c62794bdd3ccad70e5fa54dc05d9aa9601dab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/3b8c62794bdd3ccad70e5fa54dc05d9aa9601dab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/6c9405323a3f8161b9ece7e8ba09e833c445661d","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b8c62794bdd3ccad70e5fa54dc05d9aa9601dab\nparent f265730ff54a2a832217deec370874121aa85d27\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781118398 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781118398 +0200\n\ntest: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#14)\n\nAdd Cypress regression coverage for the supportTokenAdmin permission across the\nwhole stack, plus an assignable server-level admin role so the permission can be\ngranted without full server-administrator rights.\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: ship support-token-authentication-valve-administrator\n  role granting only ''administrationAccess supportTokenAdmin''.\n- register.jsx: fix the server admin route requiredPermission from the wrong\n  ''adminUsers'' to ''supportTokenAdmin'' so the fine-grained role actually gates the\n  admin UI (the per-site route keeps ''siteAdminUsers'' — separate concern).\n- tests/cypress/e2e/03-supportToken-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests proving a user\n  granted ONLY the role (never ''admin'') is denied/allowed correctly:\n    * GraphQL: supportTokenListTokens denied for unprivileged user, allowed\n      (read-only) for the role-granted user.\n    * Admin UI: panel hidden for unprivileged user, visible for role-granted user.\n- pom.xml: bump module version 3.1.0-SNAPSHOT -> 3.1.1-SNAPSHOT (roles.xml import\n  content change requires a version bump to re-import).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKbW+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAf/EQAAoLWFXV3Xs6mQxgh48tEI1K\ndONhrD7bLJ2HPCFpsTpkfDs7ZPss9jsPWewmyTEaIoeWH8JWkvLM1hi3M6Wki7kI\nvaMiazWV51BLaGVUJnBtwzrYzPyeiwzYDg/OjH6Cj1cQVDgThCxgFyaqqV7Ki6zo\nt1IN1ZTawLzpZKuKM9B/8ZRAkPUZ8W08x1e/aLlMcjpsTj0RA+1QOtQlxXGgY84v\nR5F+oYyfMU2ne4KK94qtjQX+7OUgjojQqybLnUNULD3yGFpP+JHShlc8DHbORm9h\nqhh+vvik5Ca/lpQdiCfQk10y0OXLoWZR+Av+l+vYmGjbPthMnh0L2ClXLY0A+I5g\nQDOmskZE4/Z1J6/7S/E9Oq+TSH3OhzFATfneT8VtxOY03XqaBQX4HY39LzXF8zcE\npk+JI33OEPohdKRPkCLlQLXC0tQ97BHhnBA9aTFWcrWXzlJlPFx7MdVJu/DLNp3D\nZmzBRz/pktJdVUVu0bKzVl6RxCjtHrwR0sG0CbpjJhoAVWYtthiS/jCniaRjnt+y