acted a\n   pure, testable isExpired(creationDate, minutes, now) helper.\nS2 SupportTokenUtils#addToken: return false when the target user is unknown\n   instead of reporting success for a token that was never created.\nR1 SupportTokenConstants: extract magic numbers/strings (default expiration,\n   millis-per-minute, node-name suffix length, default description) into named\n   constants; reuse them in addToken, CreateCommand and the GraphQL mutation.\nR2 Widen sanitizeForLog / isExpired to package-private for unit testing.\n\nTests: add SupportTokenExpiryTest (8) and SupportTokenLogSanitizerTest (5)\ncovering fail-closed expiry boundaries and log-injection sanitisation.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"42ff5da5675e81d1320b3b4720f3013073cff1c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/42ff5da5675e81d1320b3b4720f3013073cff1c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/351a625c013d7d4181fb589f6abfdd50235ad19f","verification":{"payload":"tree 42ff5da5675e81d1320b3b4720f3013073cff1c9\nparent a01f30cb056be43b2a6c414ab5b87e770e53c978\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781070774 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781070774 +0200\n\nfix: harden support token valve (fail-closed expiry, no misleading success)\n\nS1 valve/SupportTokenAuthenticationValve#isTokenExpired: fail closed when\n   the expiration property is missing (previously a token with no expiration\n   never expired) and treat non-positive lifetimes as expired. Extracted a\n   pure, testable isExpired(creationDate, minutes, now) helper.\nS2 SupportTokenUtils#addToken: return false when the target user is unknown\n   instead of reporting success for a token that was never created.\nR1 SupportTokenConstants: extract magic numbers/strings (default expiration,\n   millis-per-minute, node-name suffix length, default description) into named\n   constants; reuse them in addToken, CreateCommand and the GraphQL mutation.\nR2 Widen sanitizeForLog / isExpired to package-private for unit testing.\n\nTests: add SupportTokenExpiryTest (8) and SupportTokenLogSanitizerTest (5)\ncovering fail-closed expiry boundaries and log-injection sanitisation.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoo+7YACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kdRwgAqa3awS0RBorLYX995PNtk91aaHkjRlzi7jEVxbDQdrHCO7/6bEJDXZTS\nXh8bcKftvD6CwUbcmBQImcIzIVyylCitdeItC2Xq0duzOO4k8wparjwl6XgovFWK\nuezjDmsl0F6u6xRiwcltO+UzuprLJ9Ii2MVqIgHA0e0KL4Kq9BS7I9So0+CZeYRQ\nG1+bQwuyM+HrFGc0Se+OuaHb9ILTnPyUdbB504OWpjWsT8GEVfO7cO5Dvy9ETgLJ\nYbo/FZ8MOXI8T8/FTyvbIEqbP6oQRv2aMvrLJlg3D+tKXkeM55onAcqqjZ9vPX81\nUombF4v6lQaVlA6slwcH+79pQyqURg==\n=LuFZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T05:53:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commit/351a625c013d7d4181fb589f6abf