3973dedd0d929aae8a2a93b5a560","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commits/39b0302f11893973dedd0d929aae8a2a93b5a560"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commits/67c6861cb7356d8fdc1ad11710e4eab8a26b8f70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:48:17Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:48:17Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(security): set SESSION_SUPPORT_TOKEN_AUTH on token auth and block GraphQL token ops\n\nA token-authenticated session could previously call supportTokenCreate,\nsupportTokenClearAll, and supportTokenListTokens, allowing privilege\nescalation and token persistence. The valve now marks every session it\nestablishes with SESSION_SUPPORT_TOKEN_AUTH=true; all three GraphQL\noperations check this attribute and refuse the request if present,\nwiring the i18n key label.forbidden.cause.token.auth. Residual: admin\nUI route-level enforcement relies on the existing requiredPermission\nguards (adminUsers/siteAdminUsers) which are unaffected by token auth.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c1a9fb077580ebf25b634c201e903d8f26da02c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/9c1a9fb077580ebf25b634c201e903d8f26da02c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/67c6861cb7356d8fdc1ad11710e4eab8a26b8f70","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c1a9fb077580ebf25b634c201e903d8f26da02c\nparent 124ceaa2a4dbf89579d643ad3d1bb42bff457b67\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750097 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750097 +0200\n\nfix(security): set SESSION_SUPPORT_TOKEN_AUTH on token auth and block GraphQL token ops\n\nA token-authenticated session could previously call supportTokenCreate,\nsupportTokenClearAll, and supportTokenListTokens, allowing privilege\nescalation and token persistence. The valve now marks every session it\nestablishes with SESSION_SUPPORT_TOKEN_AUTH=true; all three GraphQL\noperations check this attribute and refuse the request if present,\nwiring the i18n key label.forbidden.cause.token.auth. Residual: admin\nUI route-level enforcement relies on the existing requiredPermission\nguards (adminUsers/siteAdminUsers) which are unaffected by token auth.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFxEACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3m2egf/dNBCSfIiUIo4A1sZmGYUHtWKEw1R4RL+E0GUPA4vqeqpt3Nyy32LylqO\nhMz7Y8THLsaloykXFDR6Zb66WvQZPTcoxd7xRVZiqsY4vkYB+MfQBxjvSREoL1tW\nRz4qKGgXELtew9Arr0tRimMfY5NRh4L8p2lOEbUF+NLHsg9zx6IUOtoHYI2dXbvh\nZWRfIbnt5J7x2yO7sUhpoTJdwZGCsCc/9ZE/NifdpUlMjicuZTIL8acFlutxlU+E\n7pnjAC5l8cCNOZguvN3tAjuvWagqK6wK0qckK6KRWF/WStmhYuRoxiQa6SYh5N1w\nHifi8lRGcaj3JhYuUCnsSVpy1jijQw==\n=bJL+\n---