ourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commits/1b90aea9e3f9f0af0aada1d37b69b6c8ff5ab872/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T17:58:54Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T17:58:54Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"test: update Cypress tests for confirmation dialog and regenerate yarn.lock\n\n- ''removes all tokens and shows success'': move search+create setup into the\n  test body; click st-clear-confirm after st-clear-all to go through the\n  new alertdialog confirmation step\n- ''disables clear button when no tokens exist'': search for the user first\n  so the clear button is rendered before asserting it is disabled\n- yarn.lock regenerated\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"23e9806111757c4d2cc292f387ab3a013502ab35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/23e9806111757c4d2cc292f387ab3a013502ab35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/1b90aea9e3f9f0af0aada1d37b69b6c8ff5ab872","verification":{"payload":"tree 23e9806111757c4d2cc292f387ab3a013502ab35\nparent 3d8686a74634af78781a51d4ba4ab04eb962b184\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778867934 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778867934 +0200\n\ntest: update Cypress tests for confirmation dialog and regenerate yarn.lock\n\n- ''removes all tokens and shows success'': move search+create setup into the\n  test body; click st-clear-confirm after st-clear-all to go through the\n  new alertdialog confirmation step\n- ''disables clear button when no tokens exist'': search for the user first\n  so the clear button is rendered before asserting it is disabled\n- yarn.lock regenerated\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid",