com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commits/8921985fc46ffd37994ac73b411114fa863e0eb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T11:46:30Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T11:46:30Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(a11y): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA issues — CRIT-01, MAJOR-02 to MAJOR-08, MIN-05, MIN-06, MIN-12\n\nCRIT-01: remove aria-hidden from #st-recipient-error span — aria-describedby\n         was resolving to empty because the referenced element was hidden from AT\n\nMAJOR-02: input/number border #ccc (1.61:1) → #767676 (4.54:1) — SC 1.4.11\nMAJOR-03: add .st_container button:focus-visible scoped rule — SC 2.4.7\nMAJOR-04: convert all font-size px → rem throughout SupportToken.scss — SC 1.4.4\nMAJOR-05: add required + aria-required=\"true\" to st-username search field — SC 3.3.2\nMAJOR-06: aria-invalid={!!recipientError} → aria-invalid={recipientError ? ''true'' : undefined}\n          avoids aria-invalid=\"false\" on untouched fields — SC 3.3.1\nMAJOR-07: inject copied state into srPoliteMsg live region so clipboard\n          confirmation is announced to AT — SC 4.1.3\nMAJOR-08: \"Clear All Tokens\" now opens role=alertdialog confirmation modal with\n          focus trap (Tab/Shift+Tab constrained, Escape closes), focus returns\n          to trigger button after close — SC 3.2.2\n\nMIN-05: document.title updated on mount, restored on unmount — SC 2.4.2\nMIN-06: autoComplete=\"off\" on sitekey, expiration, description inputs — SC 1.3.5\nMIN-12: token.createdDate wrapped in <time dateTime> with Intl-formatted\n        visible text — SC 1.3.1\n\nFalse positives confirmed and skipped: MAJOR-01 (#666 = 5.74:1 passes AA),\nCRIT-02 (two fixed-role live regions already present), MIN-01 (no cancel button),\nMIN-02 (tokenBoxRef targets visible element), MIN-10 (aria-labelledby conforming),\nMIN-11 (no per-row action buttons).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0598594bbded8db781ea94a2e91c7e09000a1e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/f0598594bbded8db781ea94a2e91c7e09000a1e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/8921985fc46ffd37994ac73b411114fa863e0eb1","verification":{"payload":"tree f0598594bbded8db781ea94a2e91c7e09000a1e6\nparent 8c5302d286f1c1f5ba8abf7e015624bce5102739\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778845590 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778845590 +0200\n\nfix(a11y): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA issues — CRIT-01, MAJOR-02 to MAJOR-08, MIN-05, MIN-06, MIN-12\n\nCRIT-01: remove aria-hidden from #st-recipient-error span — aria-describedby\n         was resolving to empty because the referenced element was hidden from AT\n\nMAJOR-02: input/number border #ccc (1.61:1) → #767676 (4.54:1) — SC 1.4.11\nMAJOR-03: add .st_container button:focus-visible scoped rule — SC 2.4.7\nMAJOR-04: convert all font-size px → rem throughout SupportToken.scss — SC 1.4.4\nMAJOR-05: add required + aria-required=\"true\" to st-username search field — SC 3.3.2\nMAJOR-06: aria-invalid={!!recipientError} → aria-invalid={recipientError ? ''true'' : undefined}\n          avoids aria-invalid=\"false\" on untouched fields — SC 3.3.1\nMAJOR-07: inject copied state into srPoliteMsg live region so clipboard\n          confirmation is announced to AT — SC 4.1.3\nMAJOR-08: \"Clear All Tokens\" now opens role=alertdialog confirmation modal with\n          focus trap (Tab/Shift+Tab constrained, Escape closes), focus returns\n          to trigger button after close — SC 3.2.2\n\nMIN-05: document.title updated on mount, restored on unmount — SC 2.4.2\nMIN-06: autoComplete=\"off\" on sitekey, expiration, description inputs — SC 1.3.5\nMIN-12: token.createdDate wrapped in <time dateTime> with Intl-formatted\n        visible text — SC 1.3.1\n\nFalse positives confirmed and skipped: MAJOR-01 (#666 = 5.74:1 passes AA),\nCRIT-02 (two fixed-role live regions already present), MIN-01 (no cancel button),\nMIN-02 (tokenBoxRef targets visible element), MIN-10 (aria-labelledby conforming),\nMIN-11 (no per-row action buttons).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoHB5YACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3keswgAtevgKWvK/IXI9QJwzfY89Dm0aNWgb4rQSwL/baQC4jUbl1ImFXOHRCjN\n7BkJbevilKhMKxRc6eTTAP2KO+kmq4r3yhmzfxddHfevw+5/sySfi2wNHcLky9We\nLKmaTM7neAqmPHKIQd5gPS7sMOtSBudSDnfigIMiCTYbTxreTxcvwL42Rc1LOd6q\n0FQTmR0rSwfAsAktt1dyzMlG6yOYFKsfuKPbpD3IXsWpexMwFGh9l+qxi8JaSDXS\nKDrMxItqHJunSmk9sKWq3Zmlor49uWN2lxQy2UO+nEzYywCc4n0m4I8eVzch/BsP\nOD73mJV/f1o3bBZ+b2pf00FzCX963w==\n=JMw9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T17:59:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":