1T06:10:02Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T06:10:02Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Modernize module: parent 8.2.1.0, groupId, GraphQL API, React UI, Cypress tests\n\n- Bump parent to jahia-modules:8.2.1.0; change groupId to org.jahia.community\n- Replace siteSettings dependency with graphql-dxm-provider\n- Add frontend-maven-plugin (Node v22.6.0 / Yarn v1.22.21)\n- Remove Spring WebFlow JSP UI (siteSettingsManageUsersTokens, UsersFlowHandler,\n  Constants, legacy import/, register.js) and jnt:siteSettingsManageUsersTokens CND type\n- Add GraphQL layer: SupportTokenGraphQLExtensionsProvider (DXGraphQLExtensionsProvider\n  marker), SupportTokenQueryExtension (supportTokenListTokens + GqlSupportTokenInfo DTO),\n  SupportTokenMutationExtension (supportTokenCreate, supportTokenClearAll)\n- Add React admin UI: Module Federation via webpack, register two adminRoutes\n  (administration-server-usersAndRoles and administration-sites), full token\n  management component with search, token table, create form, clear action\n- Add Cypress Docker-based test suite: docker-compose.yml, Dockerfile,\n  cypress.config.ts, two spec files (API shape + UI interaction), graphql fixtures\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"e889b54b0a24c167843e7fad2a1ee14b7066b162","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/e889b54b0a24c167843e7fad2a1ee14b7066b162"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/0020cab72c1b6e688a3a1602327c32974c647f2a","verification":{"payload":"tree e889b54b0a24c167843e7fad2a1ee14b7066b162\nparent 6ea7269e1ef6733e99280cf8519c1bf5634b9712\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778479802 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778479802 +0200\n\nModernize module: parent 8.2.1.0, groupId, GraphQL API, React UI, Cypress tests\n\n- Bump parent to jahia-modules:8.2.1.0; change groupId to org.jahia.community\n- Replace siteSettings dependency with graphql-dxm-provider\n- Add frontend-maven-plugin (Node v22.6.0 / Yarn v1.22.21)\n- Remove Spring WebFlow JSP UI (siteSettingsManageUsersTokens, UsersFlowHandler,\n  Constants, legacy import/, register.js) and jnt:siteSettingsManageUsersTokens CND type\n- Add GraphQL layer: SupportTokenGraphQLExtensionsProvider (DXGraphQLExtensionsProvider\n  marker), SupportTokenQueryExtension (supportTokenListTokens + GqlSupportTokenInfo DTO),\n  SupportTokenMutationExtension (supportTokenCreate, supportTokenClearAll)\n- Add React admin UI: Module Federation via webpack, register two adminRoutes\n  (administration-server-usersAndRoles and administration-sites), full token\n  management component with search, token table, create form, clear action\n- Add Cypress Docker-based test suite: docker-compose.yml, Dockerfile,\n  cypress.config.ts, two spec files (API shape + UI interaction), graphql fixtures\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoBcroACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lSLAf9H0a2R66BlNsPklhKLF6p1X+OzC90ZEhr9MAfb1GGRciLwQ/BBsMQQE7e\nYeED27fU8IMHlcywNBlEOpa8mae50l+IceOu7RzudE3oiWB9q1Z5+zKUO2g8OdXF\ndhNYsESPEK+p/hI0AWekvrROwpoPCeF1fWdXcfIIXF1i67cbwYlTRPq/03iwCDci\nSdbWpKSgHdm+EGK1E4zp/mrqpkBv8SX4e6ggPvYP3oyMi9cdKr6ohohXEPqnWobl\nBgKwwvismJyfWrAKXcH2JZkH2oEQzOZ2GnNKoEjqT841lBgq5Vu/i/I0VLY/RgEZ\n2sSgGzqE6AErgp15bMQL6YV1//LRNQ==\n=s46G\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-11T15:46:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.git