/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/commits/6ea7269e1ef6733e99280cf8519c1bf5634b9712/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T05:57:51Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T05:57:51Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Fix OSGi DS wiring to match auth-valve sample pattern\n\n- Inject authPipeline via @Reference(target=\"(type=authentication)\") instead\n  of SpringContextSingleton — the Pipeline IS an OSGi service\n- Inject JahiaUserManagerService via @Reference (API interface) instead of\n  static getInstance()\n- Declare service = Valve.class so the pipeline whiteboard can discover the valve\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"36b683449228fa600965547c8763f608b572e404","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/36b683449228fa600965547c8763f608b572e404"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/6ea7269e1ef6733e99280cf8519c1bf5634b9712","verification":{"payload":"tree 36b683449228fa600965547c8763f608b572e404\nparent e5f51eadae767551f16696650b56e2a47ed34cb8\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778479071 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778479071 +0200\n\nFix OSGi DS wiring to match auth-valve sample pattern\n\n- Inject authPipeline via @Reference(target=\"(type=authentication)\") instead\n  of SpringContextSingleton — the Pipeline IS an OSGi service\n- Inject JahiaUserManagerService via @Reference (API interface) instead of\n  static getInstance()\n- Declare service = Valve.c