)\n  static accessor, consistent with Karaf commands\n- Remove @Autowired from UsersFlowHandler and use JahiaUserManagerService.getInstance()\n  for all lookups\n- Delete META-INF/spring/token-authentication-valve.xml\n- Remove blueprint extender require-capability from pom.xml\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"8209d9ed11feb3c9a6142aaab00d9931d9be2b17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/trees/8209d9ed11feb3c9a6142aaab00d9931d9be2b17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-token-authentication-valve/git/commits/e5f51eadae767551f16696650b56e2a47ed34cb8","verification":{"payload":"tree 8209d9ed11feb3c9a6142aaab00d9931d9be2b17\nparent 6d90693b3c28088c1b1d63d23e8f788f37067cb9\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778478931 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778478931 +0200\n\nConvert Spring XML bean to OSGi DS\n\n- Annotate SupportTokenAuthenticationValve with @Component(immediate=true),\n  @Activate, and @Deactivate; obtain authPipeline via SpringContextSingleton\n  at activation time instead of Spring injection\n- Drop injected JahiaUserManagerService field in valve; use getInstance()\n  static accessor, consistent with Karaf commands\n- Remove @Autowired from UsersFlowHandler and use JahiaUserManagerService.getInstance()\n  for all lookups\n- Delete META-INF/spring/token-authentication-valve.xml\n- Remove blueprint extender require-capability from pom.xml\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoBb1MACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mEUAgAy5zgzwsFIDN0psKX3RK4XEIGTo5lqPIDbkZzD0y7jCUXloQ8GL3Ghxf8\nkNBQM59JeS1ZgDSf5UOEr04ryr7SMLdaQYqfHQusm7hXhISmlcm7x1nrOQPMFCw9\nTzHoiVLA3cXyWGwIaf/KXgHlVUZY6oc3ZblugQiSyLQoTNtXFXEdbRk4+8x4265N\nen6DRUUuPpcMofBUe6jgLSi2/HgWMFOgVBKgLb0cdVGqdUNJ2WkX7ODKx77UKHyP\nISmD9sTnBXOpijyp46Zkv/4irUsO/5TOpT7ejen1Xa